      <data key="d10">Semantic sensor networks; Web of Things; Internet of Things; semantic interoperability and context; social computing; collective intelligence; situation-awareness; human and machine perception; computing for human experience; social life networks; da</data>
      <data key="d11">Semantic sensor networks; Web of Things; Internet of Things; semantic interoperability and context; social computing; collective intelligence; situation-awareness; human and machine perception; computing for human experience; social life networks; da; hardware; semantics / formal methods; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Steffen Staab;Amit P. Sheth;Manfred Hauswirth;Andreas Hotho;Schahram Dustdar;Ramesh Jain;Mohan S. Kankanhalli;Axel Polleres;Geert-Jan Houben;Harith Alani;Ciro Cattuto;Josiane Xavier Parreira;Michael Granitzer;Kerry Taylor;Rajendra Akerkar;Pramod Anantharam;Payam M. Barnaghi;Benoit Christophe;Edward Curry;Emanuele Della Valle;Frieder Ganz;Laura Hollink;Artem Katasonov;Claudia Müller-Birn;RangaRao Venkatesha Prasad;Matthew Rowe;Vivek K. Singh;Markus Strohmaier;Koji Zettsu</data>
