      <data key="d9">web; society; electronic markets; interdisciplinary (computer science and economics)</data>
      <data key="d10">Negotiations; Auctions; Decision Support Systems; Software Agents</data>
      <data key="d11">Negotiations; Auctions; Decision Support Systems; Software Agents; web; society; electronic markets; interdisciplinary (computer science and economics)</data>
      <data key="d12">Rudolf Müller;Dirk Neumann;Axel Ockenfels;Stefan Seifert;Christof Weinhardt;Amir Ronen;Henner Gimpel;Carsten Block;Matthias Burghardt;Andrew Byde;Eva Chen;Rajdeep K. Dash;Tilman Eichstädt;Richard Engelbrecht-Wiggans;Shaheen Fatima;Nicholas Feltovich;Enrico Gerding;Jochen Haller;Nick Jennings;Gregory Kersten;Ryszard Kowalczyk;Stefan Luckner;Tomasz P. Michalak;Jesus Ríos;Alex C. Rogers;Carsten Schmidt;Björn Schnizler;Rustam Vahidov</data>
