                    Dirk Beyer, Marieke Huisman, Vladimir Klebanov, and Rosemary Monahan
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.4.1</data>
      <data key="d9">semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">Formal Verification; Model Checking; Deductive Verification; Competitions and Benchmarks</data>
      <data key="d11">Formal Verification; Model Checking; Deductive Verification; Competitions and Benchmarks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Bernhard Beckert;Bart Jacobs;Jaco van de Pol;Gerhard Schellhorn;Arend Rensink;Bernhard Steffen;Bernd Fischer;Carsten Sinz;Andrey Rybalchenko;Markus Schordan;Dirk Beyer;Antoine Miné;Peter Müller;Marieke Huisman;Joseph Roland Kiniry;K. Rustan M. Leino;Philipp Rümmer;David Cok;Rosemary Monahan;Wojciech Mostowski;Mattias Ulbrich;Thomas Wies;Vladimir Klebanov;Alberto Griggio;Alexey Khoroshilov;Arie Gurfinkel;Ezio Bartocci;Aws Albarghouthi;Marc Brockschmidt;Gidon Ernst;Marie Farrell;Jean-Christophe Filliâtre;Radu Grigore;Matthias Heizmann;Stefan Löwe;Petr Müller;Vadim Mutilin;Andrei Paskevich;Nadia Polikarpova;Jan Strejcek;Michael Tautschnig;Angela Wallenburg;Philipp Wendler</data>
