      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1145/3004323.3005687; https://doi.org/10.1145/3004323.3005688; https://dl.acm.org/authorize?N47184; https://doi.org/10.1080/10447318.2018.1561789; https://doi.org/10.1145/3003715.3005409; https://dl.acm.org/authorize.cfm?key=N47105; http://dx.doi.org/10.18420/muc2016-ws08-0008; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-49448-7_12; http://yannispolitis.info/uploads/tllmata.pdf; https://www.degruyter.com/view/j/icom.2016.15.issue-3/icom-2016-0034/icom-2016-0034.xml; https://doi.org/10.1145/3004323.3005686</data>
