                    Sergiu Hart, Éva Tardos, and Bernhard von Stengel
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.4.69</data>
      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d10">Algorithmic Game Theory; Economics; Internet; Nash Equilibria; Mechanism Design; Auctions</data>
      <data key="d11">Algorithmic Game Theory; Economics; Internet; Nash Equilibria; Mechanism Design; Auctions; data structures / algorithms / complexity; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d12">Berthold Vöcking;Kevin Leyton-Brown;Rudolf Müller;Rakesh V. Vohra;Tim Roughgarden;Elias Koutsoupias;Dmitrii V. Pasechnik;Nikhil Devanur Rangarajan;Jason D. Hartline;Éva Tardos;Bernhard von Stengel;Nicole Immorlica;Jeffrey MacKie-Mason;Guido Schäfer;Katrina Ligett;Vangelis Markakis;Hervé J. Moulin;Constantinos Daskalakis;Ramesh Johari;Mallesh Pai;Paul W. Goldberg;Edith Elkind;Martin Hoefer;Rahul Savani;Markus Brill;Felix Fischer;Sergiu Hart;Thomas Kesselheim;Yakov Babichenko;Simina Branzei;Jing Chen;Giorgos Christodoulou;Gabrielle Demange;Shahar Dobzinski;Paul Dütting;Michal Feldman;Yannai A. Gonczarowski;Penelope Hernandez Rojas;Max Klimm;Brendan Lucier;Vahab Mirrokni;Sigal Oren;Aaron Roth;William H. Sandholm;Michael Schapira;Ilya R. Segal;Vasilis Syrgkanis;Jens Witkowski</data>
