      <data key="d10">formal semantics; misconceptions; notional machines; computing education research</data>
      <data key="d11">formal semantics; misconceptions; notional machines; computing education research; programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Reiner Hähnle;Johan Jeuring;Jan Vahrenhold;Shriram Krishnamurthi;Markus Müller-Olm;Thomas Ball;Kathi Fisler;A. J. Ko;Matthias Hauswirth;Joseph Gibbs Politz;Robert L. Goldstone;Luke Church;Mark J. Guzdial;Felienne Hermans;Carsten Schulte;Antti-Juhani Kaijanaho;Brian Dorn;Sally Fincher;Geoffrey L. Herman;Andreas Mühling;R. Benjamin Shapiro;Juha Sorva;Steven A. Wolfman;Brett A. Becker;Neil Brown;Thomas D. LaToza;Titus Barik;Franziska Carstens;Kathryn Cunningham;Paul Denny;Benedict du Boulay;Rodrigo Duran;Barbara Ericson;Arto Hellas;Matthew C. Jadud;Philipp Kather;Colleen Lewis;Elena Machkasova;Craig Miller;Greg Nelson;Andrew Petersen;André L. Santos;Otto Seppälä;Anya Tafliovich;J. Ángel Velázquez Iturbide;Eugene Wallingford;David Weintrop</data>
