      <data key="d11">satisfiability problem; computational complexity; P-NP question; proof complexity; phase transition; combinatorics; SAT-solvers; quantified Boolean formulas; data structures / algorithms / complexity / random structures / combinatorics</data>
      <data key="d12">Uwe Egly;Andreas Goerdt;Edward A. Hirsch;Uwe Schöning;Ewald Speckenmeyer;Jan Johannsen;Oliver Kullmann;Kazuo Iwama;Victor W. Marek;Jacobo Torán;Stefan Dantchev;Evgeny Dantsin;John Franco;Nicola Galesi;Lefteris M. Kirousis;Ramamohan Paturi;Stefan Szeider;Rahul Santhanam;Alexander S. Kulikov;Jakob Nordström;Catarina Alexandra Carvalho;Nadia Creignou;Anuj Dawar;Arnaud Durand;Miki Hermann;Henning Schnoor;Heribert Vollmer;Barnaby Martin;Martina Seidl;Olaf Beyersdorff;Juha Kontinen;Arne Meier;Uwe Bubeck;Johannes Ebbing;Heidi Gebauer;Timon Hertli;Hans Kleine Büning;Donald Ervin Knuth;Massimo Lauria;Julian-Steffen Müller;Dominik Alban Scheder;Robert H. Sloan;Sean Weaver;Xishun Zhao</data>
