      <data key="d14">https://vaibhavbajpai.com/documents/papers/proceedings/hybrid-ccr-2022.pdf</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.6.14</data>
      <data key="d9">Networking and Internet Architecture</data>
      <data key="d10">carbon-footprint; energy efficient networking; climate-change</data>
      <data key="d11">carbon-footprint; energy efficient networking; climate-change; Networking and Internet Architecture</data>
      <data key="d12">Ralf Steinmetz;Georg Carle;Martina Zitterbart;Henning Schulzrinne;Wolfgang Kellerer;Srinivasan Keshav;Jörg Ott;Jari Arkko;Jürgen Schönwälder;Cristina Videira Lopes;Jon Crowcroft;Michael Menth;Alexander Raake;Georgios Smaragdakis;Vaibhav Bajpai;Daniel Karrenberg;Mirja Kühlewind;Oliver Hohlfeld;Amr Rizk;Colin Perkins;Cristel Pelsser;Mirjam Kühne;Sujata Banerjee;Quentin De Coninck;Simone Ferlin;Andrew Hines;Franziska Lichtblau</data>
