      <data key="d12">Christian Lengauer;Paul H. J. Kelly;Volker Tresp;P. (Saday) Sadayappan;Paolo Bientinesi;Richard M. Veras;Lawrence Mitchell;Charisee Chiw;Peter Braam;Jeremy Cohen;Anna Engels-Putzka;Jutho Haegeman;David Ham;Koby Hayashi;Norman Rink;Frank Verstraete;Sophia Vorderwuelbecke;Furong Huang</data>
