      <data key="d11">Scientific Visulization and Analysis; Biomedical Visulization; Integrated Multified Visulization; Uncertainty Visulization; Scalable Visulization; Computer Graphics; Computer Vision / Data Structures; Algorithms; Complexity / Multimedia / Society; HC-Interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Hans Hagen;Hans-Christian Hege;Jos B.T.M. Roerdink;Lars Linsen;Christopher R. Johnson;Georges-Pierre Bonneau;Min Chen;Leila De Floriani;David S. Ebert;Thomas Ertl;Kelly Gaither;Eduard Gröller;Charles D. Hansen;Helwig Hauser;Ingrid Hotz;Kenneth Joy;Arie Kaufman;Torsten Möller;Klaus Mueller;Ronald Peikert;Bernhard Preim;Gerik Scheuermann;Shigeo Takahashi;Gunther Weber;Thomas Wischgoll;Peer-Timo Bremer;Gordon Kindlmann;Anna Vilanova;Stefan Bruckner;Hamish Carr;Markus Hadwiger;Valerio Pascucci;Hanspeter Pfister;Robert S. Laramee;Ivan Viola;Thomas Schultz;Charl P. Botha;Yun Jang;Heike Leitte;Aidong Lu;Penny Rheingans;Anders Ynnerman;Christoph Garth;Andreas Gerndt;Vijay Natarajan;Huamin Qu;Eugene Zhang;Alireza Entezari;Jens Krüger;Miriah Meyer;Harald Obermaier;Manuel Oliveira;Tino Weinkauf;Dirk Zeckzer</data>
=======
                    Jérémy Barbay, Johannes Fischer, Stefan Kratsch, and Srinivasa Rao Satti
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.09520.pdf</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.7.44</data>
      <data key="d10">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
