                    Vaibhav Bajpai and Arthur W. Berger and Philip Eardley and Jörg Ott and Jürgen Schönwälder
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1145/2935634.2935641; http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-52153-4_13</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.1.15</data>
      <data key="d10">modelling / simulation; networks; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d11">Internet measurements; Quality of experience; Network management; Traffic engineering</data>
