      <data key="d12">John Fowler;Oliver Rose;Peter Lendermann;Scott J. Mason;Leon F. McGinnis;Lars Mönch;Gerald Weigert;Stéphane Dauzère-Pérès;Hans Ehm;Cathal Heavey;Thomas Ponsignon;Chen-Fu Chien;Ton de Kok;Kenneth Fordyce;José M. Framinán;Raphael Herding;Jesus Jimenez;Adar Kalir;Sebastian Knopp;Peng-Chieh Lee;Iris Lorscheid;Hubert Missbauer;Irfan Ovacik;Can Sun;Israel Tirkel;Reha Uzsoy;Jei-Zheng Wu</data>
