                    Matthias Bolten, Robert D. Falgout, Christian Lengauer, and Olaf Schenk
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/cpe.v29.17/issuetoc</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.4.56</data>
      <data key="d10">modelling / simulation; programming languages / compiler; software engineering</data>
      <data key="d11">stencil codes; architectural metaprogramming; linear solvers; multigrid methods; supercomputing; software engineering; massive parallelism</data>
