                    Martin Bossert, Eimear Byrne, and Antonia Wachter-Zeh
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://eceweb1.rutgers.edu/~csi/docs/Degree_Tables_for_Secure_Distributed_Matrix_Multiplication_ITW2019.pdf</data>
