      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity; networks; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d10">distributed storage; network coding; coding theory; cryptography; privacy</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">distributed storage; network coding; coding theory; cryptography; privacy; data structures / algorithms / complexity; networks; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d12">Iryna Andriyanova;Daniel Augot;Martin Bossert;Heide Gluesing-Luerssen;Marcus Greferath;Anna-Lena Horlemann-Trautmann;Margreta Kuijper;Felice Manganiello;Sihem Mesnager;Joachim Rosenthal;Emina Soljanin;Jens Zumbrägel;Sascha Kurz;Eimear Byrne;Salim El Rouayheb;Allison Beemer;Jessalyn Bolkema;Tuvi Etzion;Daniel Heinlein;Julia Lieb;Carolyn Mayer;Alessandro Neri;Mario Osvin Pavcevic;Sven Puchinger;Alberto Ravagnani;John Sheekey;Sidharth Jaggi;Gianira Nicoletta Alfarano;Rawad Bitar;Giuseppe Cotardo;Marwa Dammak;Alexey Frolov;Philippe Gaborit;Oliver Wilhelm Gnilke;Lukas Holzbaur;Jörg Kliewer;Stanislav Kruglik;Julien Lavauzelle;Hunter Lehmann;Andreas Lenz;Pierre Loidreau;Cornelia Ott;Julian Renner;Ronny Roth;Carmen Sippel;Razane Tajeddine;Violetta Weger;Eitan Yaakobi;Yiwei Zhang;Antonia Wachter-Zeh</data>
