      <data key="d12">Peter I. Cowling;Günter Rudolph;Olivier Teytaud;Nathan Sturtevant;Bruno Bouzy;Michael Buro;Alex J. Champandard;Mike Preuß;Tom Schaul;Pieter Spronck;Tommy Thompson;Julian Togelius;Georgios N. Yannakakis;Dan Ashlock;Michael Cook;Mark J. Nelson;Spyridon Samothrakis;Mark Winands;Cameron Browne;Jialin Liu;Diego Perez Liebana;Sebastian Risi;Jacob Schrum;Emily Short;Vanessa Volz;Yngvi Björnsson;Alan Blair;Duygu Cakmak;Tristan Cazanave;Jakob Foerster;Raluca D. Gaina;Katja Hofmann;Setareh Maghsudi;Nantas Nardelli;Tómas Philip Rúnarsson;Christoph Salge;Chiara F. Sironi;Hui Wang</data>
