                    Shai Ben-David and Ruth Urner 
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.09282</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.9.94</data>
      <data key="d10">artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d11">Machine learning; theory of computing; unsupervised learning; representation learning; clustering</data>
