      <data key="d11">inductive program synthesis; end-user programming; constraint programming; probabilistic programming; cognitive modeling; artificial intelligence / robotics; programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d12">Harold Boley;William B. Langdon;Luc De Raedt;Stephen H. Muggleton;Ruzica Piskac;Armando Solar-Lezama;Sumit Gulwani;Ute Schmid;Janis Voigtländer;Frank Jäkel;Lorijn van Rooijen;Umair Zafrulla Ahmed;Tarek Richard Besold;José Hernández-Orallo;Petra Hofstedt;Susumu Katayama;Fernando Martinez-Plumed;Martin Möhrmann;Michael Siebers;Rishabh Singh;Benjamin Zorn;Gustavo Soares;Andrew Cropper;Cesar Ferri Ramirez;Hila Peleg;Maria José Ramirez Quintana;Claes Strannegård;Christina Zeller</data>
