      <data key="d11">Information systems; uncertainty; inconsistency; beliefs; artificial intelligence / robotics; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity; extra_classification = self-organizing systems</data>
      <data key="d12">Norbert Fuhr;Christoph Koch;Thomas Seidl;Dan Olteanu;Birgitta König-Ries;Anthony Hunter;Jef Wijsen;Myra Spiliopoulou;Peter Dittrich;Vasilis Vassalos;Ouri E. Wolfson;Rudolf Kruse;Christopher Ré;Heinz Schweppe;Maurice van Keulen;Thomas Neumann;Ihab Francis Ilyas;Pierre Senellart;Martin Theobald;Sonja Buchegger;Lyublena Antova;Hidir Aras;Yassen Assenov;Clemens Beckstein;Christian Böhm;Anish Das Sarma;Ander De Keijzer;Guy De Tre;Amol Deshpande;Todd J. Green;Peter J. Haas;Thomas Hubauer;Ela Hunt;Seung-won Hwang;Andranik Khachatryan;Friederike Klan;Hans-Joachim Lenz;Volker Markl;Tom Matthé;Jeff Z. Pan;Claudia Plant;Matthias Renz;Pritviraj Sen;Mirco Stern</data>
