      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">machine learning; computer vision; computational biology; domain adaptation; multitask learning; transfer learning; dataset selection bias; dependent and non-i.i.d. data; artificial intelligence / robotics; bioinformatics; computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d12">Joachim Denzler;Gunnar Rätsch;Ingo Steinwart;Josef Kittler;Massimiliano Pontil;Tobias Scheffer;Trevor Darrell;Shai Ben-David;Christoph H. Lampert;Soeren Laue;Alessandro Lazaric;Ruth Urner;Gilles Blanchard;Philipp Drewe;Mario Fritz;Judy Hoffman;Marius Kloft;Brian Kulis;Victor Lempitsky;Christoph Lippert;Stephan Mandt;Shin Nakajima;Francesco Orabona;Erik Rodner;Kate Saenko;Dino Sejdinovic;Fei Sha;Oliver Stegle;Ilya Tolstikhin;Alexander Zimin</data>
