      <data key="d15">2</data>
      <data key="d11">Boolean satisfiability; SAT solving; computational complexity; proof complexity; combinatorial optimization; Computational Complexity; Data Structures and Algorithms; Logic in Computer Science</data>
      <data key="d12">Armin Biere;Malte Helmert;Torsten Schaub;Pavel Pudlák;Stefan Szeider;Ryan Williams;Laura Kovács;Albert Oliveras;Jakob Nordström;Meena Mahajan;Nikolaj S. Bjørner;Matti Järvisalo;Laurent Simon;Olaf Beyersdorff;Vijay Ganesh;Antonina Kolokolova;Susanna de Rezende;Mikoláš Janota;Marc Vinyals;Marijn J. H. Heule;Martin Suda;Friedrich Slivovsky;Ambros M. Gleixner;Benjamin Böhm;Daniela Kaufmann;Chunxiao (Ian) Li;Kuldeep S. Meel;Jeremias Berg;Bart Bogaerts;Jonas Conneryd;Katalin Fazekas;Mathias Fleury;Mexi Gioni;Ciaran McCreesh;Andy Oertel;Andre Schidler;Yong Kiam Tan;Dieter Vandesande;Emre Yolcu</data>
