      <data key="d10">adaptive analysis; instance optimal algoritms; fixed parameter tractable; output sensitive algorithms</data>
      <data key="d15">0</data>
      <data key="d11">adaptive analysis; instance optimal algoritms; fixed parameter tractable; output sensitive algorithms; computer graphics / computer vision; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Kurt Mehlhorn;Gerhard J. Woeginger;David G. Kirkpatrick;Rolf Klein;Christian Knauer;Raimund Seidel;Rudolf Fleischer;Marek Karpinski;Michael R. Fellows;Rolf Niedermeier;Frances A. Rosamond;Ulrike Stege;Friedhelm Meyer auf der Heide;Alejandro Lopez-Ortiz;Ian Munro;Kim Skak Larsen;Rüdiger Reischuk;Joan Boyar;Marek Chrobak;Leah Epstein;Lene Monrad Favrholdt;Jiong Guo;Nicole Megow;Magdalena Grüber;Dániel Marx;Spyros Angelopoulos;Reza Dorrigiv;Daniel Raible;Saket Saurabh;Nadja Betzler;Stefan Kratsch;Daniel Lokshtanov;Yoshio Okamoto;Jérémy Barbay;Shai Ben-David;Sagi Ben-Moshe;Luca Castelli Aleardi;Britta Dorn;Martin R. Ehmsen;Amr Elmasry;Vladimir Estivill-Castro;Robert Fraser;Alexander Johannes Langer;Hadas Shachnai;Sandra Zilles</data>
