      <data key="d11">refactoring; program analysis; program transformation; software evolution; reengineering; software restructuring; code smells; programming languages / compiler; software engineering</data>
      <data key="d12">Stephan Diehl;Robert Bowdidge;Marcio Cornelio;Alejandra Garrido;Frank Tip;Don Batory;Tom Mens;Kim Mens;Simon J. Thompson;Jurgen J. Vinju;Oscar M. Nierstrasz;Ran Ettinger;Andrew P. Black;John Brant;Volker Stolz;Friedrich Steimann;Ira D. Baxter;Rohit Gheyi;Caius Brindescu;Danny Dig;William G. Griswold;Shinpei Hayashi;Felienne Hermans;Jongwook Kim;Huiqing Li;Francesco Logozzo;Naouel Moha;Emerson Murphy-Hill;Bill Opdyke;Christopher J. Parnin;Javier Perez;Veselin Raychev;Don Roberts;Max Schaefer;Gustavo Soares;Peter Sommerlad;Kathryn T. Stolee;Eli Tilevich;Mohsen Vakilian;Louis Wasserman;Jan Wloka</data>
