      <data key="d12">Michael Gerndt;Jürgen Teich;Wolfgang E. Nagel;Martin Schulz;David Montoya;Sri Parameswaran;Isaías Alberto Comprés Ureña;Michael Knobloch;Barry L. Rountree;Jonathan Eastep;Kathleen Shoga;Axel Auweter;Sergio Bampi;Andrea Bartolini;Kirk Cameron;Pietro Cicotti;Siddharth Garg;Michael Glaß;Per Gunnar Kjeldsberg;Tulika Mitra;Michael Niemier;Santiago Pagani;Tapasya Patki;Andrey Semin</data>
