                    Glenn Geers, Monika Sester, Stephan Winter, and Ouri E. Wolfson
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1392/paper-14.pdf</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.12.97</data>
      <data key="d9">mobile computing; optimization / scheduling; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d10">Computational transportation science; intelligent transportation systems; social computing</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Computational transportation science; intelligent transportation systems; social computing; mobile computing; optimization / scheduling; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Monika Sester;Stephan Winter;Peter Sanders;Stefan Funke;Patrick Laube;Franziska Klügl;Ouri E. Wolfson;Walied Othman;Sabine Timpf;Dirk Christian Mattfeld;Glenn Geers;Alexandros Labrinidis;Steve Liang;Harvey J. Miller;Bo Xu;Thomas Liebig;Sabine Storandt;Francesco Ciari;Caitlin Doyle Cottrill;Sergio Di Martino;Jan Fabian Ehmke;Rob Fitzpatrick;Sergio Ilarri;Benjamin Kickhöfer;Seng Wai Loke;Nicole Ronald;Yang Yue</data>
