                    Zinaida Benenson, Marianne Junger, Daniela Oliveira, and Gianluca Stringhini
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2001.02912.pdf; https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.07046; https://doi.org/10.1109/eCrime47957.2019.9037589; https://doi.org/10.1145/3394231.3397902</data>
