      <data key="d12">Zinaida Benenson;Matt Bishop;William Robertson;Gabriele Lenzini;Jeremy J. Epstein;Michael Sirivianos;Claude Castelluccia;Gareth Tyson;Daniela Oliveira;Simon Parkin;Jeff Yan;Joe Calandrino;Manuel Egele;Stefan Schiffner;Gianluca Stringhini;Savvas Zannettou;Abhishta Abhishta;Jan-Willem Bullée;Deanna Caputo;Yi Ting Chua;Natalie Ebner;Matthew Edwards;Freya Gassmann;Alice Hutchings;Marianne Junger;Katsiaryna Labunets;Elmer Lastdrager;Ivan Srba;Sophie van Der Zee;Sebastian Wachs;Victoria Wang</data>
