      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">security; secure routing; communication networks; future internet; privacy and anonymity; mobile and wireless networks; networks; security / cryptology; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d12">Gene Tsudik;Saleem Bhatti;Joel M. Halpern;Jean-Pierre Seifert;Panagiotis Papadimitratos;Amir Herzberg;Matthias Hollick;Thomas C. Schmidt;Matthias Wählisch;Michael Schapira;Randy Bush;Rossella Mattioli;Haya Shulman;Steven Bellovin;Ivan Martinovic;Cristina Nita-Rotaru;Michael Noisternig;Adrian Perrig;Raphael Reischuk;Alvaro Retana;Mahesh Tripunitara;Laurent Vanbever;Allison Mankin</data>
