                    Cristina Abad, Ian T. Foster, Nikolas Herbst, and Alexandru Iosup
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.04159; https://doi.org/10.1109/MIC.2021.3093105</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.4.34</data>
      <data key="d9">Distributed / Parallel / and Cluster Computing; Emerging Technologies; Software Engineering</data>
      <data key="d10">serverless computing; cloud continuum; software architecture; systems management; vision</data>
      <data key="d11">serverless computing; cloud continuum; software architecture; systems management; vision; Distributed / Parallel / and Cluster Computing; Emerging Technologies; Software Engineering</data>
      <data key="d12">Bartosz Balis;Alexandru Iosup;Hans-Arno Jacobsen;Ian T. Foster;Omer F. Rana;André van Hoorn;Samuel Kounev;Guillaume Pierre;Erik Elmroth;Kyle Chard;Martina Maggio;Andrew A. Chien;Maciej Malawski;Pooyan Jamshidi;Philipp Leitner;Alexandru Uta;André Bauer;Simon Eismann;Nikolas Herbst;Cristina Abad;Samer Al-Kiswany;Ahmed Ali-Eldin Hassan;André B. Bondi;Ryan L. Chard;Robert Chatley;A. Jesse Jiryu Davis;Jesse Donkervliet;Nicola Ferrier;Georgios Kousiouris;Pedro García López;Bernard Metzler;Vinod Muthusamy;Alessandro Vittorio Papadopoulos;Panos Patros;Robert P. Ricci;Joel Scheuner;Mina Sedaghat;Mohammad Shahrad;Prashant Shenoy;Josef Spillner;Davide Taibi;Douglas Thain;Animesh Trivedi;Vincent van Beek;Erwin van Eyk;Soam Vasani;Florian Wamser;Guido Wirtz;Vladimir Yussupov</data>
