                    René Glebke, John S. Baras, Sandra Hirche, Kay Römer, and Klaus Wehrle
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.9.5.132</data>
      <data key="d9">modelling / simulation; networks; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d10">Cyber-Physical Systems; Cyber-Physical Networks; Communication; Control Theory</data>
      <data key="d11">Cyber-Physical Systems; Cyber-Physical Networks; Communication; Control Theory; modelling / simulation; networks; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Georg Carle;Martina Zitterbart;Klaus Wehrle;Wolfgang Kellerer;Kay Römer;James Gross;Wolfgang Schröder-Preikschat;Andrei Gurtov;Tobias Heer;Olaf Stursberg;Aaron Ding;Marcel Carsten Baunach;Marco Zimmerling;John S. Baras;Sankar Basu;Carlos Canudas-de-Wit;Rolf Findeisen;Hannes Frey;René Glebke;Thorsten Herfet;Sandra Hirche;Na Li;Mingyan Liu;Mohammad Hossein Mamduhi;Adam Molin;Ehsan Nekouei;Chrysa Papagianni;Daniel Quevedo;Sebastian Trimpe;Herbert Werner;Gerhard Wunder</data>
