      <data key="d12">Eli Ben-Sasson;Ron Lavi;Tim Roughgarden;Christian Cachin;Roger Wattenhofer;Alex Biryukov;Bryan Ford;Stefan Katzenbeisser;Aviv Zohar;Rainer Böhme;Edgar Weippl;Ghassan Karame;Nicolas Christin;Tyler W. Moore;Joseph Bonneau;Foteini Baldimtsi;Ittay Eyal;Aljosha Judmayer;Svetlana Abramova;Sarah Azouvi;Mic Bowman;Dominic Breuker;Lisa Eckey;Christina Garman;Arthur Gervais;Philipp Jovanovic;Assimakis Agamemnon Kattis;Patrik Keller;Patrick McCorry;Ian Miers;Malte Möser;Neha Narula;Tim Ruffing;Emin Gün Sirer;Yonatan Sompolinsky;Itay Tsabary;Florian Tschorsch;Marie Vasek</data>
