      <data key="d12">Jürgen Teich;Babak Falsafi;Ulrich Kremer;Norbert Wehn;Phillip Stanley-Marbell;Jie Han;Sri Parameswaran;Eva Darulova;Sara Achour;Andreas Burg;Andreas Gerstlauer;Sasa Misailovic;Adrian Sampson;Damien Zufferey;Hussam Amrouch;David Atienza Alonso;Eric Atkinson;Lara Dolecek;Djordje Jevdjic;Debasmita Lohar;R.Iris Bahar;Swarnendu Biswas;Peter Dueben;Ghayoor Gillani;Anastasiia Izycheva;Vijay Janapa Reddi;Gauri Joshi;Laura Monroe;Olivier Sentieys;Radha Venkatagiri;Georgios Zervakis</data>
