      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Fault tolerance; resilience; energy efficiency; distributed and high performance computing.; data structures / algorithms / complexity; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Thilo Kielmann;Uwe Schwiegelshohn;Alix Munier;Carsten Franke;Dieter Kranzlmüller;Bernd Mohr;Felix Wolf;Padma Raghavan;Andrei Tchernykh;Frédéric Vivien;Wolfgang E. Nagel;Dominik Göddeke;Sascha Hunold;Jeffrey S. Vetter;George Bosilca;Sabri Pllana;Olivier Beaumont;Anne Benoit;Henri Casanova;Julien Herrmann;Loris Marchal;Yves Robert;Oliver Sinnen;Veronika Sonigo;Satoshi Matsuoka;Sadaf Alam;Ewa Deelman;Rafael Ferreira da Silva;Michael Gerhards;Fredy Juarez;Kate Keahey;Julien Langou;Maciej Malawski;Rami Melhem;Jaroslaw Nabrzyski;Manish Parashar;Ilia Pietri;Suraj Prabhakaran;Stephan Schlagkamp;Renata Slota;Leonel Sousa</data>
