      <data key="d15">0; 0; 0; 0; 0; 0; 0; 0</data>
      <data key="d11">Authenticity; Integrity; Privacy; Block Ciphers; Stream Ciphers; Hash Functions; Provable Security; Cryptanalysis; security / cryptography</data>
      <data key="d12">Matthias Krause;Stefan Lucks;Erik Zenner;Eli Biham;Antoine Joux;Bart Preneel;Phillip Rogaway;Serge Vaudenay;Frederik Armknecht;Elena Andreeva;Alex Biryukov;Rafi Chen;Nicolas T. Courtois;Joan Daemen;Christophe De Cannière;Markus Dichtl;Orr Dunkelman;Henri Gilbert;Louis Granboulan;Helena Handschuh;Tetsu Iwata;Thomas Johansson;Ulrich Kühn;Alexander Maximov;Willi Meier;Florian Mendel;Shiho Moriai;Kaisa Nyberg;Norbert Pramstaller;Christian Rechberger;Vincent Rijmen;Greg Rose;Dirk Stegemann;Marion Videau;Ralf-Philipp Weinmann;Doug Whiting</data>
