      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Stone-Priestley duality; point free topology; infinite computations; exact real number computation; computability in analysis; hierarchies; reducibility; topological complexity; domain theory; semantics; recognizability; profinite topology; data structures / algorithms / complexity; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Ulrich Berger;Helmut Schwichtenberg;Andrej Bauer;Vasco Brattka;Peter Hertling;Matthias Schröder;Peter M. Schuster;Victor Selivanov;Klaus Weihrauch;Reinhold Heckmann;Achim Jung;Klaus Keimel;Hans-Peter Albert Künzi;Jimmie D. Lawson;Dieter Spreen;Veronica Becher;Sebastiaan A. Terwijn;Giuseppe Rosolini;Paul Taylor;Serge Grigorieff;Andreas Krebs;Marc Zeitoun;Jean-Eric Pin;Mai Gehrke;Alessandra Palmigiano;Paul-Andre Mellies;Pascal Weil;Matthew de Brecht;Hannes Diener;Willem L. Fouché;Luca Motto Ros;Arno Pauly;Jorge Almeida;Karin Cvetko-Vah;Georges Hansoul;Ganna Kudryavtseva;Rutger Kuyper;Yoshihiro Maruyama;Davide Rinaldi;Antonino Salibra;Sam van Gool;Lorijn van Rooijen</data>
