                    Julie Cohen and Sven Dietrich and Mireille Hildebrandt and Aiko Pras and Lenore D. Zuck
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/SPW.2014.43</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.1.170</data>
      <data key="d9">security / cryptology; society / human-computer interaction; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d10">Ethics; Data Sharing; Data Dissemination; Ethics across borders; Anonymization; Sanitization</data>
      <data key="d11">Ethics; Data Sharing; Data Dissemination; Ethics across borders; Anonymization; Sanitization; security / cryptology; society / human-computer interaction; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d12">Volker Roth;Burkhard Stiller;Georg Carle;Lenore D. Zuck;Peter Y. A. Ryan;Aiko Pras;Jürgen Schönwälder;Radu State;Anna Sperotto;Sven Dietrich;Sam Weber;Jon Callas;Julie E. Cohen;Ronald Leenes;Darren Shou;Jeroen van der Ham;Roland van Rijswijk-Deij;Aimee van Wynsberghe;Da-Wei Wang;Mireille Hildebrandt</data>
