      <data key="d10">complexity theory; problem solving; cognitive psychology; computational trade-offs</data>
      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">complexity theory; problem solving; cognitive psychology; computational trade-offs; artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Michael R. Fellows;Frances A. Rosamond;Ulrike Stege;Todd Wareham;Alexandra Kirsch;John K. Tsotsos;Iris van Rooij;Wolfgang Maass;Matthias Mnich;Mark Blokpoel;Sarah Carruthers;Liane Gabora;Yll Haxhimusa;Frank Jäkel;Brendan Juba;Johan Kwisthout;Zygmunt Pizlo;Niels A. Taatgen;Sashank Varma;Tarek Richard Besold;Martin Möhrmann;Burcu Arslan;Christopher Cherniak;Nicole Cruz de Echeverria Loebell;Harmen de Weerd;Nadine Fleischhut;Emmanuel Genot;Nina Gierasimczuk;Vinod Goel;Justine Jacot;Etienne Koechlin;Antonina Kolokolova;Falk Lieder;David Noelle;Stellan Ohlsson;Maria Otworowska;Constantin Rothkopf;Zahra Sajedinia;Marieke Sweers;Rineke Verbrugge;Scott Watson</data>
