                    Amel Bennaceur, Dimitra Giannakopoulou, Reiner Hähnle, and Karl Meinke
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007%2F978-3-319-96562-8</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.4.161</data>
