      <data key="d12">Reiner Hähnle;Bengt Jonsson;Bernhard Steffen;Radu Grosu;Neil Walkinshaw;Frits Vaandrager;Zvonimir Rakamaric;Andrzej Wasowski;Amel Bennaceur;Dimitra Giannakopoulou;Andreas Abel;Dalal Alrajeh;Pavol Bielik;Roland Groz;Falk Howar;Karl Meinke;Mohammad Reza Mousavi;Daniel Neider;Alessandra Russo;Sicco Verwer</data>
