      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Multidirectional model transformation; synchronisation; consistency; traceability; model-driven development; data bases / information retrieval; programming languages / compiler; software engineering</data>
      <data key="d12">Ralf Lämmel;Perdita Stevens;Jens Holger Weber;James McKinna;Martin Gogolla;Albert Zündorf;Jeremy Gibbons;Holger Giese;Andy Schürr;Bernhard Rumpe;Bran V. Selic;Bernhard Westfechtel;Ekkart Kindler;Gabor Karsai;Matthias Tichy;Fiona A. C. Polack;Friedrich Steimann;Zinovy Diskin;Anthony Anjorin;Anthony Cleve;Soichiro Hidaka;Michael Johnson;Kazutaka Matsuda;Frank Trollmann;James Cheney;Dominique Blouin;Vadim Zaytsev;Gabor Bergmann;Sebastian Copei;Davide Di Ruscio;Tsushima Kanae;Heiko Klare;Hsiang-Shang Ko;Harald König;Yngve Lamo;Théo Le Calvar;Nuno Macedo;Blake S, Pollard;Robert Rosebrugh;Nils Weidmann</data>
