      <data key="d12">Alexander Barvinok;Hartmut Klauck;Troy Lee;Ronald de Wolf;LeRoy B. Beasley;Samuel Fiorini;Nicolas Gillis;Francois Glineur;João Gouveia;Alexander Guterman;Volker Kaibel;Kanstantsin Pashkovich;Sebastian Pokutta;Yaroslav Shitov;Dirk Oliver Theis;Rekha R. Thomas;Hans Raj Tiwary;Stefan Weltge;David Steurer;Greg Blekherman;Daniel Dadush;Sebastian Gruler;Kaie Kubjas;James R. Lee;Arnau Padrol Sureda;Teresa Piovesan;Raman Sanyal;Markus Schweighofer;Jonathan Swenson;Antonios Varvitsiotis</data>
