&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; FDA, "FDA Launches Initiative to Reduce Infusion Pump Risks", News Release, April 23, 2010 (see: http://www.fda.gov/NewsEvents/Newsroom/PressAnnouncements/ucm209042.htm)
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;
R. Bloomfield and P. Bishop.  Safety and assurance cases: Past,
present and possible future - an Adelard perspective.  In Dale, C., Anderson, T., eds.: Making Systems Safer, Proceedings of the Eighteenth Safety-Critical Systems Symposium, Bristol, UK (February 2010) 51-67.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; A. Wassyng, T. Maibaum, M. Lawford and H. Behr. Is there a case against safety cases?. Submitted to post-proceedings volume of Monterey 2010 Workshop, to be published in LNCS.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt; 
