      <data key="d12">Jan Van den Bussche;Serge Abiteboul;Gerome Miklau;Arnaud Sahuguet;Gerhard Weikum;Gerald Friedland;Wolfgang Nejdl;Evaggelia Pitoura;Marcelo Arenas;Suresh Venkatasubramanian;Krishna P. Gummadi;Agnès Voisard;Irini Fundulaki;Benny Kimelfeld;Amélie Marian;Eric Simon;Salvatore Ruggieri;Claude Castelluccia;Bettina Berendt;Pauli Miettinen;Julia Stoyanovich;Nicholas Diakopoulos;Solon Issac Barocas;Chaitanya Baru;Claudia Bauzer Medeiros;Marina Drosou;Sorelle Friedler;Michael Hay;Bill Howe;H. V. Jagadish;Benjamin Nguyen;Rishiraj Saha Roy;Jannik Strötgen;Fabian Suchanek;Kristene Unsworth;Nicholas Weaver;Christo Wilson;Cong Yu;Ben Zevenbergen</data>
