      <data key="d12">Anna Gál;Hartmut Klauck;Troy Lee;Stephen Kirkland;Lek-Heng Lim;LeRoy B. Beasley;Hamza Fawzi;Samuel Fiorini;Nicolas Gillis;Francois Glineur;João Gouveia;Alexander Guterman;Volker Kaibel;Raghav Kulkarni;Thomas Laffey;Nathan Linial;Pablo A. Parrilo;Kanstantsin Pashkovich;Sebastian Pokutta;Richard Robinson;Yaroslav Shitov;Adi Shraibman;Dirk Oliver Theis;Rekha R. Thomas;Hans Raj Tiwary;Stefan Weltge</data>
