      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Artificial Morality; Machine Ethics; Computational Morality; Autonomous Systems; Intelligent Systems; Formal Ethics; Mathematical Philosophy; Robot Ethics.; artificial intelligence / robotics; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Michael Fisher;Holger Hermanns;Jan M. Broersen;Louise A. Dennis;Marija Slavkovik;Alan FT Winfield;Christian List;Marcus Pivato;Michael Anderson;Albert Anglberger;Zohreh Baniasadi;Kevin Baum;Vincent Berenz;Vicky Charisi;Sjur K. Dyrkolbotn;Joseph Y. Halpern;Johannes Himmelreich;John F. Horty;Susan Leigh Anderson;Robert Lieck;Andreas Matthias;James H. Moor;Marek Sergot;Janina Sombetzki;Kai Spiekermann;Roman V. Yampolskiy</data>
