      <data key="d12">Rafael Accorsi;Wil van der Aalst;Alessandro Provetti;Jonathan Cook;Roland Rieke;Ernesto Damiani;Hajo A. Reijers;Stefanie Rinderle-Ma;Barbara Weber;Alessandro Sperduti;Christian Günther;Anne Rozinat;Thomas Stocker;Antonio Caforio;Josep Carmona;Paolo Ceravolo;Jan Claes;Massimiliano de Leoni;Benoit Depaire;Simon N. Foley;Luciano Garcia-Banuelos;Anna A. Kalenkova;Akhil Kumar;Geetika T. Lakshmanan;Teemu Lehto;Marcello Leida;Maria Leitner;Fabrizio Maria Maggi;Ronny S. Mans;Alexey A. Mitsyuk;Jorge Munoz-Gama;Zbigniew Paszkiewicz;Joel Tiago Ribeiro;Ricardo Seguel;Marcos Sepulveda Fernandez;Sergey A. Shershakov;Pnina Soffer;Minseok Song;Boudewijn van Dongen;Frank van Geffen;Eric Verbeek;Thomas Vogelgesang;Jianmin Wang;Ton Weijters</data>
