      <data key="d11">Similarity-based clustering and classification; prototype-based classifiers; self-organisation; SOM; learning vector quantization; medical diagnosis; bioinformatics; AI; Soft computing; Interdisciplinary (medicine/biology)</data>
      <data key="d12">Hans Burkhardt;Joachim Selbig;David Saad;Alexander Hasenfuss;Barbara Hammer;Michael Biehl;Rainer Breitling;Nestor Caticha;Eytan Domany;Colin Fyfe;David Hoyle;Samuel Kaski;John A. Lee;Yang Li;Thomas Martinetz;Erzsébet Merényi;Johannes Mohr;Peter Riegler;Michal Rosen-Zvi;Fabrice Rossi;Lidia Sanchez-Gonzalez;Craig Saunders;Frank-Michael Schleif;Petra Schneider;Udo Seiffert;Marc Strickert;David M. J. Tax;Peter Tino;Michel Verleysen;Thomas Villmann;Ulrike von Luxburg;Michael Wilkinson;Aree Witoelar</data>
