      <data key="d12">Andrea Lodi;Karen Aardal;Yingqian Zhang;Marco Lübbecke;Louis-Martin Rousseau;Tias Guns;Pascal Van Hentenryck;Sebastian Pokutta;Lars Kotthoff;Kevin Tierney;Serdar Kadioglu;Michele Lombardi;Andrea Micheli;Oktay Gunluk;Ruth Misener;Neil Yorke-Smith;Claudia D'Ambrosio;Bistra Dilkina;Ferdinando Fioretto;Emma Frejinger;Maxime Gasse;Stefano Gualandi;Hoong Chuin Lau;Pierre Le Bodic;Sofia Michel;Laurent Perron;Helge Spieker;Pashootan Vaezipoor;Stefan Voß</data>
