      <data key="d12">Leopoldo Bertossi;Maria Paola Bonacina;Ian Horrocks;Renate Schmidt;Oliver Kullmann;Joao Marques-Silva;Stefan Szeider;Thomas Meyer;Uli Sattler;Cesare Tinelli;Jakob Nordström;Meghyn Bienvenu;Renata Wassermann;Matti Järvisalo;Olaf Beyersdorff;David Carral;Rafael Penaloza;Magdalena Ortiz;Jean-Marie Lagniez;Emmanuel Hebrard;Ana Ozaki;Stefan Borgwardt;Camille Bourgaux;Aaron Eberhart;Jordi Planes;Anni-Yasmin Turhan;Carlos Ansotegui;Alexey Ignatiev;Carlos Mencia;Francesco Ricca;David Tena Cucala</data>
