                    Bernadette Charron-Bost, Stephan Merz, Andrey Rybalchenko, and Josef Widder
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.4.1</data>
      <data key="d9">networks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">Distributed algorithms; semi-automated proofs; model checking</data>
      <data key="d11">Distributed algorithms; semi-automated proofs; model checking; networks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Fabrice Kordon;Stephan Merz;Klaus Schneider;Karsten Wolf;John Rushby;Philippe Schnoebelen;Helmut Veith;Marie Duflot;Andrey Rybalchenko;Cormac Flanagan;André Schiper;Uwe Nestmann;Christoph Weidenbach;Josef Widder;Serdar Tasiran;Victor Luchangco;Bernadette Charron-Bost;Matthias Függer;Jennifer L. Welch;Alexey Gotsman;Akash Lal;Serge Haddad;Thomas Nowak;Igor Konnov;Béatrice Bérard;Péter Bokor;Borzoo Bonakdarpour;Pierre Castéran;Gerwin Klein;Eric Ruppert;Wilfried Steiner;Murali Talupur</data>
