                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Alejandro Lopez-Ortiz, Ulrich Carsten Meyer, Markus E. Nebel, and Robert Sedgewick
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1145/3293883.3295706; https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.01189; http://dx.doi.org/10.1145/2851141.2851169; https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.04040; http://dx.doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.SoCG.2017.37; https://doi.org/10.1109/HPEC.2016.7761646; https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.08513; https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.04906; https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.04495; https://dl.acm.org/ft_gateway.cfm?id=3039712&amp;ftid=1832448&amp;dwn=1&amp;CFID=814002304&amp;CFTOKEN=49370865</data>
