      <data key="d12">Vasco Brattka;Margarita Korovina;Joseph S. Miller;Matthias Schröder;Victor Selivanov;Alex Simpson;Martin Ziegler;Reinhold Heckmann;Elvira Mayordomo;André Otfrid Nies;Jan Reimann;Daisuke Ikegami;Jacques Duparc;Theodore A. Slaman;Steffen Lempp;Olivier Finkel;Matthew de Brecht;Vassilios Gregoriades;Takayuki Kihara;Luca Motto Ros;Arno Pauly;Svetlana Selivanova;Johanna N. Y. Franklin;Daniel Turetsky;Damir D. Dzhafarov;Eike Neumann;Raphael Carroy;Iskander Shagitovich Kalimullin;Alexander Melnikov;Russell G. Miller;Keng Meng Ng;Mariya I. Soskova;Linda Westrick;Jun Le Goh;Mathieu Hoyrup;Takako Nemoto;Riccardo Camerlo;Ivan Georgiev;Adam Ó Conghaile;Marcin Sabok;Alexandra A. Soskova;Alessandro Andretta;Nikolay Bazhenov;Ruiyuan (Ronnie) Chen;Ekaterina Fokina;Corrie Ingall;Josiah Jacobsen-Grocott;Davorin Lesnik;Neil Lutz;Alexey Ostrovsky;Philipp Schlicht</data>
