      <data key="d9">computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d10">Computational Fabrication; 3D Printing; 4D Printing; Geometric Modeling; Shape Perception</data>
      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Computational Fabrication; 3D Printing; 4D Printing; Geometric Modeling; Shape Perception; computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d12">Leif Kobbelt;Marc Alexa;Mark Pauly;Tim Weyrich;Moritz Bächer;Bernd Bickel;Manfred Lau;Sylvain Lefebvre;Sara McMains;Nico Pietroni;Ryan Schmidt;Kristina Shea;Melina Skouras;Bernhard Thomaszewski;Nobuyuki Umetani;Alec Jacobson;Georges Fadel;Thomas Auzinger;Vahid Babaei;Amit Haim Bermano;Sabine Demey;Laura Devendorf;Madeline Gannon;Serena Graziosi;Jessica K. Hodgins;Scott Hudson;Lin Sebastian Kayser;David I. W. Levin;Lin Lu;Jonas Martinez-Bayona;Radomir Mech;Ankur Mehta;Shuhei Miyashita;Caitlin Mueller;Julian Panetta;Nadya Peek;Thijs Roumen;Carolyn C. Seepersad;Philipp Urban;Charlie Wang;Christopher Bryant Williams;Maria Yablonina</data>
