      <data key="d12">Gilles Barthe;Christel Baier;Joost-Pieter Katoen;Annabelle McIver;David Parker;Alessandra Di Pierro;Cédric Fournet;Sriram K. Rajamani;Catuscia Palamidessi;Joel Ouaknine;Lijun Zhang;Angelika Kimmig;Avi Pfeffer;Andrew D. Gordon;Ugo Dal Lago;Stefan Kiefer;Chung-Kil Hur;Michael Carbin;Cameron Freer;Alexandra Silva;Boris Köpf;Pasquale Malacaria;Geoffrey Smith;Johannes Borgström;Aleksandar Chakarov;Jason Eisner;Yuan Feng;Luis Maria Ferrer Fioriti;Marco Gaboardi;Friedrich Gretz;Johannes Hölzl;Benjamin Kaminski;Vikash Mansinghka;Piotr Mardziel;Tahiry Rabehaja;Norman Ramsey;Chung-chieh Shan;Sameer Singh;Andreas Stuhlmüller;Frank Wood;Mingsheng Ying</data>
