      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.1.67</data>
      <data key="d9">modelling / simulation; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d10">Crisis Response; Humanitarian Aid</data>
      <data key="d11">Crisis Response; Humanitarian Aid; modelling / simulation; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Stefan Pickl;Ulrike Lechner;Ozlem Ergun;Simon French;Bernd Hellingrath;Volker Wulf;Edwin Bakker;Oliver Block;Kateryna Bondar;Matthias Brechmann;Ozgur Dedehayir;Hanno Friedrich;Ivo Häring;Erich Heumüller;Nico Kaptein;Bernhard Katzy;Nicole Krämer;Erik Kropat;Dietmar Kühne;Francesc Miralles;Wolfgang Reinhardt;Jens Schwarter;Gideon Shimshon;Christina Weber;Nils B. Weidmann;Heiko Werner;Luk van Wassenhove</data>
