                        Creative Commons BY 4.0
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Daniel Král', Michal Pilipczuk, Sebastian Siebertz, and Blair D. Sullivan
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2202.05299; https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.13014; https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.16900</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.8.115</data>
      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d10">algorithm design; parameterized complexity; sparse graphs; graph decompositions; model theory</data>
      <data key="d11">algorithm design; parameterized complexity; sparse graphs; graph decompositions; model theory; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Martin Grohe;Luc Segoufin;Daniel Král';Fedor V. Fomin;Petr Hlinený;Dimitrios M. Thilikos;Jaroslav Nešetril;Sang-il Oum;Nicole Schweikardt;Stephan Kreutzer;Jan Obdržálek;Anuj Dawar;Saket Saurabh;Benjamin Rossman;Szymon Torunczyk;Archontia C. Giannopoulou;Marcin Pilipczuk;Michal Pilipczuk;Felix Reidl;Torsten Ueckerdt;Gwenaël Joret;O-joung Kwon;Blair D. Sullivan;Sebastian Siebertz;Zdenek Dvorák;Édouard Bonnet;Jakub Gajarský;Martin Koutecký;Alexandre Vigny;Marthe Bonamy;Marcin Brianski;Jan Dreier;Kord Eickmeyer;Meike Hatzel;Noleen Koehler;Nikolas Mählmann;Piotr Micek;Wojciech Nadara;Patrice Ossona de Mendez;Kristýna Pekárková;Felix Schröder;Bartosz Walczak;Saeed Amiri;Daniel Cranston;Peter Gartland;Mario Grobler;Shweta Jain;Ken-ichi Kawarabayashi;Aurelie Lagoutte;Brian Lavallee;Rose McCarty;Yosuke Mizutani;Filip Pokrývka;Evangelos Protopapas;Wojciech Przybyszewski;Daniel Quiroz;Nicole Schirrmacher;Marek Sokolowski;Giannos Stamoulis;Nate Veldt;David Wood</data>
