                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.2.122</data>
      <data key="d9">modelling / simulation; optimization / scheduling; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d10">logical execution time; real-time systems; control; multicore architectures</data>
      <data key="d11">logical execution time; real-time systems; control; multicore architectures; modelling / simulation; optimization / scheduling; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d12">Rolf Ernst;Florence Maraninchi;Dirk Ziegenbein;Alain Girault;James H. Anderson;Gerhard Fohler;Sophie Quinton;Glenn Farrall;Benoit Dupont de Dinechin;Martina Maggio;Björn B. Brandenburg;Christoph M. Kirsch;Claire Pagetti;Leonie Ahrendts;Matthias Beckert;Alessandro Biondi;Bert Boeddeker;Sylvain Cotard;Marco Di Natale;Mathieu Jan;Karl Henrik Johansson;Sebastian Kehr;Stefan Kuntz;Ralph Mader;Jorge Luis Martinez Garcia;Andreas Naderlinger;Moritz Neukirchner;Borislav Nikolic;Nathan Otterness;Paolo Pazzaglia;Christophe Prévot;Stefan Resmerita;Hermann von Hasseln;Eugene Yip;Martin Simons</data>
