                    Falai Chen, Tor Dokken, Thomas A. Grandine, and Stefanie Hahmann
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/journal/15240703/82/supp/C; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cagd.2016.08.001; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cad.2016.05.013</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.5.68</data>
