      <data key="d11">geometric modeling; shape design; geometry; computer graphics; geometry processing; isogeometric analysis; 3D content generation; design optimization.; computer graphics / computer vision; modelling / simulation</data>
      <data key="d12">Hans Hagen;Ioannis Emiris;Konrad Polthier;Leif Kobbelt;Hartmut Prautzsch;Pere Brunet;Gershon Elber;Ron Goldman;Thomas A. Grandine;Stefanie Hahmann;Myung-Soo Kim;Tom Lyche;Géraldine Morin;Ulrich Reif;Tamas Várady;Wenping Wang;Bernard Mourrain;Kai Hormann;Falai Chen;Jens Gravesen;Bert Jüttler;Tae-wan Kim;Rimvydas Krasauskas;Jörg Peters;Helmut Pottmann;Malcolm A. Sabin;Georg Umlauf;Vadim Shapiro;Yaron Lipman;Richard F. Riesenfeld;Scott Schaefer;Hiromasa Suzuki;Elaine Cohen;Tor Dokken;Ligang Liu;Ewald Quak;Maria Lucia Sampoli;Oliver Barrowclough;Laurent Buse;Nicole Lehmann;Georg Muntingh;Peter Noertoft;Jarek Rossignac;Nelly Villamizar</data>
