      <data key="d11">program instrumentation; performance analysis; performance modeling; parallel and distributed computing; sw-engineering; optimization/scheduling; modeling simulation; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d12">Barton P. Miller;Vladimir S. Getov;Adolfy Hoisie;Darren Kerbyson;Dieter Kranzlmüller;Allen D. Malony;Bernd Mohr;Jesper Larsson Träff;Harvey Wasserman;Felix Wolf;Jeffrey K. Hollingsworth;Holger Brunst;Luiz DeRose;Guido Juckeland;Michael Kluge;Anna Morajko;Matthias S. Müller;Philip Roth;Martin Schulz;Brian J. N. Wylie;Mary Zosel;Erich Strohmaier;Kevin Barker;Daniel Becker;Andrew Bernat;Barbara M. Chapman;Sudip Dosanjh;Markus Geimer;Judit Gimenez;Kevin A Huck;Heike Jagode;Terry Jones;Matthias Jurenz;Rainer Keller;David Klepacki;Jesus Labarta;Ewing Lusk;Sally A. McKee;John Mellor-Crummey;Hartmut Mix;Oleg Morajko;Frank Mueller;Heidi Poxon;Radu Prodan;Simone Sbaraglia;Jim Tomkins;Jeffrey S. Vetter;Patrick Worley</data>
