                    Peter Bürgisser, Leslie Ann Goldberg, Mark Jerrum, and Pascal Koiran
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.1.47</data>
      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d10">exact counting; approximate counting; holographic algorithms; computational complexity of counting; algebraic complexity of counting; applications to constraint satisfaction; graph polynomials</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">exact counting; approximate counting; holographic algorithms; computational complexity of counting; algebraic complexity of counting; applications to constraint satisfaction; graph polynomials; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Martin Dyer;Leslie Ann Goldberg;Mark R. Jerrum;Marek Karpinski;Mike S. Paterson;Johann A. Makowsky;Uwe Schöning;Markus Bläser;Andrei A. Bulatov;Pascal Koiran;Natacha Portier;Magnus Bordewich;Arnaud Durand;Miki Hermann;Meena Mahajan;David Richerby;Thore Husfeldt;Holger Dell;He Sun;Leslie Valiant;Peter Bürgisser;Radu Curticapean;Bruno Grenet;Guillaume Malod;Colin McQuillan;Stefan Mengel;Peter Scheiblechner;Irénée Briquel;Xi Chen;Jo Ellis-Monaghan;Hervé Fournier;Andreas Göbel;Heng Guo;Kitty Meeks;Daniel Stefankovic;Yann Strozecki;Sébastien Tavenas;Pascal Vontobel;William Whistler;Tyson Williams;Mingji Xia;Tomoyuki Yamakami;Chihao Zhang</data>
