&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Idris A Eckley, Paul Fearnhead, and Rebecca Killick. Analysis of changepoint models. In David Barber, A. Taylan Cemgil, and Silvia Chiappa, editors, Bayesian Time Series Models,
chapter 10, pages 205–224. Cambridge University Press, Cambridge, 2011.
