      <data key="d12">Frank Kurth;Masataka Goto;Meinard Müller;Simon Dixon;Emilia Gómez;Cynthia Liem;Tomoyasu Nakano;Geoffroy Peeters;Ye Wang;Anja Volk;Christof Weiß;Rachel Bittner;Estefanía Cano Cerón;Michèle Castellengo;Pritish Chandna;Helena Cuesta;Johanna Devaney;Zhiyao Duan;Antoine Liutkus;Juhan Nam;Ryo Nishikimi;Polina Proutskova;Preeti Rao;Sebastian Rosenzweig;Justin Salamon;Frank Scherbaum;Sebastian J. Schlecht;Li Su;Tomoki Toda;Julián Urbano;Yi-Hsuan Yang;Frank Zalkow</data>
