      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Finite model theory; Descriptive Complexity; Database Theory; Model Checking; Algorithms; Knowledge Representation; Independence Logic; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Dietrich Kuske;Thomas Schwentick;Jan Van den Bussche;Erich Grädel;Wolfgang Thomas;Martin Grohe;Luc Segoufin;Dan Suciu;Albert Atserias;Jerzy Marcinkowski;Dietmar Berwanger;Kousha Etessami;Carsten Lutz;Anuj Dawar;Arnaud Durand;Phokion G. Kolaitis;Heribert Vollmer;Lauri Hella;Thomas Colcombet;Mikolaj Bojanczyk;Claire David;Martin Otto;Victor Vianu;Etienne Grandjean;Jouko Väänänen;Thomas Zeume;Manfred Kufleitner;Diego Figueira;Szymon Torunczyk;Joanna Ochremiak;Lidia Tendera;Scott Weinstein;Christoph Berkholz;Faried Abu Zaid;Svenja Schalthöfer;Sebastian Siebertz;Nils Vortmeier;Sandra Kiefer;Ronald Fagin;Jakub Gajarský;James F. Lynch;Wied Pakusa;Gregory Wilsenach</data>
