      <data key="d12">Bettina Speckmann;Marc van Kreveld;Carola Wenk;Siva Ravada;Panos Kypros Chrysanthis;Mario A. Nascimento;Gennady Andrienko;Natalia V. Andrienko;Matthias Renz;Esteban Zimanyi;Sanjay Chawla;Dimitrios Gunopulos;Demetris Zeinalipour;Egemen Tanin;Li Xiong;Walid Aref;Taylor Anderson;Amr Magdy;Mahmoud Sakr;Flora Salim;Maxime Schoemans;Andreas Züfle;Jussara Almeida;Eric Auquiere;Yang Cao;Reynold Cheng;Xiqi Fei;Gabriel Ghinita;Anita Graser;Joon-Seok Kim;Kyoung-Sook Kim;Peer Kröger;John Krumm;Johannes Lauer;Mohamed Mokbel;Dimitris Sacharidis;Mohamed Sarwat;Cyrus Shahabi;Yannis Theodoridis;Kristian Torp;Martin Werner;Song Wu;Jianqiu Xu;Moustafa Youssef;Dimitris Zissis</data>
