      <data key="d9">multimedia; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d10">Audio Analysis; Signal Processing; Machine Learning; Sound; Speech; Music; Affective Computing</data>
      <data key="d11">Audio Analysis; Signal Processing; Machine Learning; Sound; Speech; Music; Affective Computing; multimedia; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Frank Kurth;Meinard Müller;Sebastian Ewert;Gaël Richard;Björn Schuller;Xavier Anguera;Jon Barker;Stephan Baumann;Murtaza Bulut;Carlos Busso;Nick Campbell;Laurence Devillers;Jonathan Driedger;Bernd Edler;Anna Esposito;Cédric Févotte;Jort Gemmeke;Franz Graf;Martin Heckmann;Dorothea Kolossa;Gernot Kubin;Sungbok Lee;Florian Metze;Roger K. Moore;Emily Mower Provost;Shrikanth S. Narayanan;Nobutaka Ono;Bryan Pardo;Alexandros Potamianos;Bhiksha Raj;Mark Sandler;Joan Serrà;Rita Singh;Paris Smaragdis;Stefano Squartini;Shiva Sundaram;Khiet Truong;Christian Uhle;Emmanuel Vincent;Tuomas Virtanen</data>
