      <data key="d12">Vitaly Shmatikov;Paulo Jorge Esteves-Veríssimo;Oliver Kohlbacher;Adam Davison Smith;Gene Tsudik;Bradley Malin;Florian Kerschbaum;Stefan Katzenbeisser;Thorsten Strufe;Emiliano De Cristofaro;Jean Pierre Hubaux;Carmela Troncoso;Erman Ayday;Marina Blanton;Zekeriya Erkin;Jacques Fellay;Kay Hamacher;Zhicong Huang;Mathias Humbert;Muhammad Naveed;Jean-Louis Raisaro;Xiao Feng Wang;Dan Bogdanov;Luk Arbuckle;Aniket Kate;Florian Kohlmayer;Alexander Kaitai Liang;Huang Lin;Adam Molyneaux;Jun Pang;Fabian Prasser;Manuel Prinz;Kurt Rohloff;Sean Simmons;Qiang Tang;Juan Ramon Troncoso Pastoriza</data>
