                    Erika Abraham, Alberto Avritzer, Anne Remke, and William H. Sanders
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.entcs.2014.12.010</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.1.36</data>
      <data key="d9">modelling / simulation; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">Critical Infrastructures; Smart Grids; Modeling; Randomized Timed and Hybrid Models; Analysis</data>
      <data key="d11">Critical Infrastructures; Smart Grids; Modeling; Randomized Timed and Hybrid Models; Analysis; modelling / simulation; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Bernd Becker;Hermann de Meer;Christel Baier;Boudewijn Haverkort;Holger Hermanns;Joost-Pieter Katoen;Gethin Norman;William H. Sanders;Markus Siegle;Martin Fränzle;Gerard J. M. Smit;Luca Bortolussi;Jeremy T. Bradley;Verena Wolf;Marijn R. Jongerden;Anne Remke;Lucia Kapová Happe;Erika Abraham;Alessandro Abate;Ralf Wimmer;Alberto Avritzer;Felicita Di Giandomenico;Aad van Moorsel;Katinka Wolter;Marc Bouissou;Laura Carnevali;Hamed Ghasemieh;Marco Gribaudo;Dennis Guck;Mauro Iacono;Zbigniew Kalbarczyk;Anne Koziolek;Peter Langendörfer;Rom Langerak;John Lygeros;Daniel Sadoc Menasche;Albert Molderink;Maria Prandini;Sahra Sedigh Sarvestani;Oliver Stecklina;Armando Tacchella;Enrico Vicario</data>
