      <data key="d12">Hans Hagen;Tamal K. Dey;Georges-Pierre Bonneau;Ingrid Hotz;Gunther Weber;Hamish Carr;Christoph Garth;Vijay Natarajan;Eugene Zhang;Michael Kerber;Claudia Landi;Primoz Skraba;Yue Zhang;Ulrich Bauer;Bei Wang Phillips;Roxana Bujack;Pawel Dlotko;Michael Lesnick;Julien Tierny;Filip Sadlo;Ranita Biswas;Oliver Gäfvert;Arnur Nigmetov;Emilie Purvine;Vanessa Robins;Paul Rosen;Hubert Wagner</data>
