                    Philip Bille, Markus Lohrey, Sebastian Maneth, and Gonzalo Navarro
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://www.dcc.uchile.cl/~gnavarro/ps/spire17.2.pdf; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-67428-5_4; https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.09538; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-67428-5_5</data>
