      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Data Compression; Indexing; Algorithms on Compressed Structures; Straight- Line Programs; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Manfred Schmidt-Schauss;Ian Munro;Rajeev Raman;Srinivasa Rao Satti;Juha Kärkkäinen;Alexander Tiskin;Yakov Nekrich;Stefan Böttcher;Markus Lohrey;Shunsuke Inenaga;Sebastian Maneth;Gonzalo Navarro;Wojciech Rytter;Hiroshi Sakamoto;Ayumi Shinohara;Markus Schmid;Travis Gagie;Djamal Belazzougui;Philip Bille;Johannes Fischer;Pawel Gawrychowski;Artur Jez;Susana Ladra González;Patrick K. Nicholson;Rahul Shah;Rossano Venturini;Simon Gog;Diego Arroyuelo;Hideo Bannai;Rodrigo Cánovas;Patrick Hagge Cording;Héctor Ferrada;Adrià Gascón;Inge Li Gørtz;Cecilia Hernández Rivas;Danny Hucke;Tomohiro I;Alberto Ordóñez;Fabian Peternek;Nicola Prezza;Tatiana Starikovskaya</data>
