      <data key="d15">0; 0</data>
      <data key="d11">Petri nets; statecharts; pi-calculus; concurrency; constraints; process algebra; model checking; boolean networks; communicating automata; hybrid models; differntial equations; stochastic modeling; modeling/simulation; networks; semantics/specification/formal methods; verifcation/logic; </data>
      <data key="d12">Jerzy Tiuryn;David Gilbert;Adelinde M. Uhrmacher;Torsten Schaub;Monika Heiner;Satoru Miyano;Juris Viksna;Gianluigi Zavattaro;Andrzej M. Kierzek;Ina Koch;Céline Kuttler;Hiroshi Matsuno;Joachim Niehren;Anna Gambin;Gregory Batt;Luca Cardelli;Jane Hillston;Corrado Priami;Rainer Breitling;Wan Fokkink;M. Tauqeer Alam;Heike Assmus;Johnrob Y. Bantang;Alexander Bockmayr;Nicola Bonzanni;Frank J. Bruggeman;Federica Ciocchetta;Maria Pamela C. David;Andrea Degasperi;Finn Drabløs;Simon Hardy;Sampsa Hautaniemi;John K. Heath;Domitille Heitzler;Mathias John;Elzbieta Krepska;Marek Kwiatkowski;Cédric Lhoussaine;Wolfgang Marwan;Carsten Maus;Eduardo Mendoza;Alberto Policriti;Haluk Resat;Alessandro Romanel;David Šafránek;Heike Siebert;Sylvain Soliman;P.S. Thiagarajan;Denis Thieffry;Cristian Versari;Simon Youssef;Liying Yu</data>
