      <data key="d12">Eric Allender;Harry Buhrman;Anna Gál;Johan Hastad;Michal Koucký;Rüdiger Reischuk;Thomas Thierauf;Lance Fortnow;Jacobo Torán;Ramamohan Paturi;Pavel Pudlák;Sophie Laplante;Rahul Santhanam;Prahladh Harsha;Alexander S. Kulikov;Till Tantau;Ryan Williams;Amnon Ta-Shma;Jakob Nordström;Meena Mahajan;Oded Regev;Amit Chakrabarti;Kristoffer Arnsfelt Hansen;Virginia Vassilevska Williams;Arkadev Chattopadhyay;Swastik Kopparty;Olaf Beyersdorff;Srikanth Srinivasan;Michael E. Saks;Stacey Jeffery;Sourav Chakraborty;Shubhangi Saraf;Amir Yehudayoff;Omri Weinstein;Rohit Gurjar;Igor Carboni Oliveira;Nutan Limaye;Anindya De;Alexander Golovnev;Ben Lee Volk;Yuval Filmus;Robert Robere;Max Bannach;Lijie Chen;Mika Göös;Shuichi Hirahara;Rahul Ilango;Gillat Kol;Ian Mertz;Toniann Pitassi;Amit Sinhababu;Li-Yang Tan</data>
