      <data key="d12">Tanja Lange;Lejla Batina;Jorge Guajardo Merchan;Pim Tuyls;Nele Mentens;Ilia Polian;Georg Sigl;Georg T. Becker;Christian Boit;Jan Burchard;Wayne P. Burleson;Jean-Luc Danger;Linus Feiten;Domenic Forte;Fatemeh Ganji;Swaroop Ghosh;Tim Erhan Güneysu;Sorin A. Huss;Michael Hutter;Ramesh Karri;Osnat Keren;Roel Maes;Debdeep Mukhopadhyay;Ruben Niederhagen;Sikhar Patranabis;Elad Peer;Wenjing Rao;Francesco Regazzoni;Ulrich Rührmair;Kazuo Sakiyama;Werner Schindler;Shahin Tajik;Mark M. Tehranipoor</data>
