                    Carola Doerr, Christian Igel, Lothar Thiele, and Xin Yao
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.09227; https://doi.org/10.1109/TEVC.2019.2917014; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-99259-4_1; https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.00964; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-29414-4_2; https://doi.org/10.1145/3205455.3205606; https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.08647; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tcs.2018.02.011; https://doi.org/10.1145/3205455.3205576; https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tcs.2019.09.002; https://hal.archives-ouvertes.fr/hal-01662568; https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.10087</data>
