                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Martin Johns, Nick Nikiforakis, Melanie Volkamer, and John Wilander
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.8.1</data>
      <data key="d9">security / cryptology; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d10">Web Security</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Web Security; security / cryptology; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d12">Luca Compagna;Thomas Gross;Tamara Rezk;Andrei Sabelfeld;Ben Livshits;Melanie Volkamer;Matteo Maffei;Konrad Rieck;Lieven Desmet;Martin Johns;John Wilander;Rigo Wenning;Mario Heiderich;Boris Hemkemeier;Nick Nikiforakis;Sebastian Schinzel;Achim D. Brucker;Steven Englehardt;Lukasz Olejnik;Dolière Francis Somé;Frederik Braun;Stefano Calzavara;Marian Harbach;Daniel Hausknecht;John Hazen;Christoph Kerschbaumer;Pierre Laperdrix;Sebastian Lekies;Marius Musch;Juan David Parra;Giancarlo Pellegrino;Karen Renaud;Zubair Shafiq;Lynsay Shepherd;Ben Stock;Daniel Veditz;Malte Wedel;Mike West;Henrik Willert</data>
