      <data key="d12">Alberto Marchetti-Spaccamela;Rolf H. Möhring;Thomas Erlebach;Jiri Sgall;Martin Skutella;Jan Karel Lenstra;Leen Stougie;Yossi Azar;Seffi Naor;Kirk Pruhs;Clifford Stein;Rob van Stee;Éva Tardos;Nicole Megow;Guido Schäfer;Marc Uetz;Tjark Vredeveld;René Sitters;Shuchi Chawla;David Shmoys;Ola Svensson;Sanjoy Baruah;Christoph Dürr;Britta Peis;Thomas Rothvoss;Jose Verschae;Sungjin Im;Samir Khuller;Benjamin J. Moseley;Naveen Garg;Thomas Kesselheim;Amit Kumar;Kamesh Munagala;Viswanath Nagarajan;Max Klimm;Tobias Harks;Jannik Matuschke;Neil Olver;Laura Vargas Koch;Antonios Antoniadis;Andreas Wiese;Kevin Schewior;Etienne Bamas;Christian Coester;Sami Davies;Franziska Eberle;Ruben Hoeksma;Sven Jäger;Xinrui Jia;Peter Kling;Marilena Leichter;Sebastien Martin;Sarah Morell;Jens Quedenfeld;Shijin Rajakrishnan;Lars Rohwedder;Bertrand Simon;Vera Traub;Victor Verdugo</data>
