      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Computational Mass Spectrometry; Proteomics; Computational Biology; Integrative Bioinformatics; Large Scale Public Data; bioinformatics</data>
      <data key="d12">Oliver Kohlbacher;Sebastian Böcker;Nuno Bandeira;John Cottrell;Bernhard Küster;Eric Deutsch;Lukas Käll;Kathryn Lilley;Lennart Martens;Hannes Röst;Stephen Tate;Olga Vitek;Robert Chalkley;Laurent Gatto;Timo Sachsenberg;Magnus Arntzen;Harald Barsnes;Ileana M. Cristea;Bernard Delanghe;Viktoria Dorfer;Julien Gagneur;Marco Hennrich;Nico Jehmlich;Jeroen Krijgsveld;Lydie Lane;Frédérique Lisacek;Gerben Menschaert;Bart Mesuere;Thilo Muth;Magnus Palmblad;Phillip Pope;Veit Schwämmle;Elien Vandermarliere;Hans Vissers;Juan Antonio Vizcaino;Pieter-Jan Volders;Mathias Walzer;Ana L. Wang;Mathias Wilhelm;Paul Wilmes;Dennis Wolan;Henrik Zauber</data>
