      <data key="d11">algorithms; software; experiments; repeatability; reproducibility; benchmarks; data sets; data structures / algorithms / complexity; programming languages / compiler; software engineering</data>
      <data key="d12">Kurt Mehlhorn;Camil Demetrescu;Petra Mutzel;Dorothea Wagner;Norbert Fuhr;Peter Sanders;Walter F. Tichy;Ian Munro;David S. Johnson;Catherine C. McGeoch;Andrew V. Goldberg;Roger Wattenhofer;J. Eliot B. Moss;Marco Lübbecke;Markus Chimani;Jan Vitek;David A. Bader;Erik Ernst;Matthias Hagen;Benjamin Hiller;Umut A. Acar;Matthias Hauswirth;Petr Tuma;Ronald F. Boisvert;José Nelson Amaral;Daniel Delling;Luís Paquete;Sebastian Fischmeister;Judith Bishop;Marco Chiarandini;Emilio Coppa;Amer Diwan;Dmitry Duplyakin;Eric Eide;Paolo G. Giarrusso;Richard Jones;Tomas Kalibera;Mauricio Resende;Nodari Sitchinava;Peter F. Sweeney</data>
