      <data key="d12">Dieter Gollmann;Sjouke Mauw;Mass Soldal Lund;Zinaida Benenson;Carrie Gates;Ketil Stølen;Shari Lawrence Pfleeger;Martina Angela Sasse;Roland Rieke;Paul Smith;Trajce Dimkov;Gabriele Lenzini;Wolter Pieters;Kai Rannenberg;Sören Bleikertz;Sebastian Pape;Rainer Böhme;Cormac Herley;Sven Übelacker;Dina Hadziosmanovic;Simon N. Foley;Tristan Caulfield;Kas P. Clark;Carlo Harpes;Roeland Kegel;Vincent Koenig;Stewart Kowalski;Aleksandr Lenin;Daniela Oliveira;Frank Pallas;Simon Parkin;Axel Tanner;Michel van Eeten;Jan Willemson;Jeff Yan</data>
