&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Christian S. Collberg and Todd A. Proebsting. Repeatability in Computer Systems Research. In http://doi.acm.org/10.1145/2812803, Communications of the ACM, 2016. doi:10.1145/2812803.
