      <data key="d9">data bases / information retrieval; programming languages / compiler; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d10">high-performance computing; data-intensive research; language-integrated query; language-based security</data>
      <data key="d11">high-performance computing; data-intensive research; language-integrated query; language-based security; data bases / information retrieval; programming languages / compiler; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d12">Jan Van den Bussche;Jan Hidders;Christoph Koch;Frank Neven;Dan Suciu;Stijn Vansummeren;Giuseppe Castagna;Christopher Ré;Fritz Henglein;Jan Vitek;Torsten Grust;Jens Teubner;Thomas Neumann;Umut A. Acar;Todd J. Green;Alexey Gotsman;Nate Foster;Alexander Alexandrov;Tim Kraska;James Cheney;Tiark Rompf;Alexander Ulrich;Yanif Ahmad;Carsten Binnig;Laurent Daynès;Pierre Geneves;Sam Lindley;Todd Mytkowicz;Ryan R. Newton;Kim Nguyen;Klaus Ostermann;Andrew Stevenson;Julia Stoyanovich;Marcos Vaz Salles;Dimitrios Vytiniotis;Ryan Wisnesky</data>
