                    Ricardo Duarte and Björn Eskofier and Martin Rumpf and Josef Wiemeyer
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.9.38</data>
      <data key="d9">modelling / simulation</data>
