      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">artificial intelligence; computer graphics; computer vision; databases; information retrieval; modeling; simulation; ubiquitous computing; pattern recognition; machine learning; big data; knowledge discovery; data-mining; modelling / simulation</data>
      <data key="d12">Dietmar Saupe;Martin Rumpf;Jim Little;Arnold Baca;Martin Lames;Jürgen Perl;Karen Roemer;Josef Wiemeyer;Daniel Link;Roland Leser;Stuart Morgan;Malte Siegle;Ricardo Duarte;Björn Eskofier;Patrick Lucey;Michael Stöckl;Anna Volossovitch;Eva Dorschky;Stefan Endler;Irfan A. Essa;Hugo Folgado;Katrin Hoffmann;Anne Danielle Koelewijn;John Komar;Bernhard Moser;Robert Rein;Tiago Guedes Russomanno;Heiko Schlarb;Antonie van den Bogert;Hendrik Weber</data>
