      <data key="d11">Information Visualization; Data Visualization; Visualization; Graph Drawing; Visual Network Analysis; Biology; Bioinformatics; Social Sciences; Software Engineering; Visualization; Computer Graphics / Computer Vision; Society / HCI</data>
      <data key="d12">Stephan Diehl;Peter Eades;Carsten Görg;Andreas Kerren;John T. Stasko;Hans Hagen;Falk Schreiber;Stephen G. Kobourov;Lothar Krempel;Michelle X. Zhou;Robert Kosara;Jarke J. van Wijk;Matthew O. Ward;Daniel A. Keim;James Abello;Oliver Kohlbacher;Helen C. Purchase;Martin Nöllenburg;T. J. Jankun-Kelly;Kai Xu;Jean-Daniel Fekete;Kwan-Liu Ma;Guy Melançon;Silvia Miksch;Jonathan C. Roberts;Jing Yang;Alexandru C. Telea;Tim Dwyer;Michael Wybrow;Niklas Elmqvist;Jessie Kennedy;Christophe Hurter;Daniel Archambault;Danny Holten;Katy Börner;Maura Conway;Helen Gibson;Benjamin David Hennig;A. Johannes Pretorius;Tatiana von Landesberger;Björn Zimmer</data>
