      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">visualization; image processing; tensor fields; diffusion-weighted imaging (DWI); partial differ- ential equations (PDEs); higher-order descriptors; feature extraction; fiber tracking; structural mechanics; fluid dynamics; computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d12">Hans Hagen;Jos B.T.M. Roerdink;Ingrid Hotz;Gerik Scheuermann;Xavier Tricoche;Bernhard Burgeth;Evren Özarslan;Anna Vilanova;Thomas Schultz;Georgeta Elisabeta Marai;Rodrigo Moreno;Luc Florack;Andrea Fuster;Tom Dela Haije;Burak Acar;Maryam Afzali-Deligani;Anders Eklund;Aasa Feragen;Andrada Ianus;Cheng Guan Koay;Chunlei Liu;Jaya Sreevalsan Nair;Benoit Scherrer;Alexandra Tobisch;Gözde Ünal;Yue Zhang;Valentin Zobel</data>
