      <data key="d11">web applications; security; ajax; web 2.0; analysis for security; browser design; distributed applications; web; security / cryptography; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d12">Joachim Posegga;Dieter Gollmann;Shriram Krishnamurthi;Cédric Fournet;Michael Hicks;Andrei Sabelfeld;Alessandro Orso;Sergio Maffeis;Ben Livshits;Thorsten Holz;Jochen Haller;Trevor Jim;Brendan Eich;Phu Phung;Dan Boneh;Engin Kirda;Kevin Borders;Lieven Desmet;Ulfar Erlingsson;David Evans;Sebastian Gajek;Salvatore Guarnieri;William Halfond;Martin Johns;Christoph Kern;Florian Kerschbaum;Jasvir Nagra;Anh Nguyen-Tuong;Frank Piessens;Marco Pistoia;Charlie Reis;William Robertson;Jörg Schwenk;Nikhil Swamy;Venkat N. Venkatakrishnan;Giovanni Vigna;John Wilander;Yves Younan</data>
