      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">mathematical biology; computational biology; algorithmic bioinformatics; pattern discovery networks; phylogenetics; stringology; bioinformatics; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Benny Chor;Peter F. Stadler;Andreas Spillner;Mike Steel;Ayse Funda Ergun;Gabriel Valiente;Sven Rahmann;Alberto Apostolico;Péter L. Erdös;Laxmi Parida;Alex Pothen;Matteo Comin;Fabio Cunial;Andreas Dress;Matthias Gallé;Raffaele Giancarlo;Stefan Gruenewald;Concettina Guerra;Jack Koolen;Matthias Löwe;Axel Mosig;Rahul Siddharthan;Jörg Ackermann;Jonas S. Almeida;Eduardo Corel;Yupeng Cun;Gilles Didier;Mareike Fischer;Alex Grossmann;Katharina T. Huber;Deok-Soo Kim;James A. Lake;Qiang Li;Tobias Marschall;Christoph Mayer;Burkhard Morgenstern;Walter Schubert;Susana Vinga;Shuhua Xu;Jun Yan</data>
