      <data key="d12">Paola Inverardi;Hartmut Schmeck;Kurt Geihs;Joost-Pieter Katoen;Marta Kwiatkowska;Evgenia Smirni;Alexandru Iosup;Holger Giese;Artur Andrzejak;Steffen Becker;Lars Grunske;Christian Becker;Kirstie Bellman;Chris Landauer;Xin Yao;Giuliano Casale;Nelly Bencomo;Heiko Koziolek;Antonio Filieri;Samuel Kounev;Katinka Wolter;Sebastian Götz;Sara Bouchenak;Andrea Zisman;Javier Cámara;Anne Koziolek;Martina Maggio;Peter R. Lewis;Tarek F. Abdelzaher;Lydia Y. Chen;Ada Diaconescu;Lukas Esterle;Francesco Gallo;Henry Hoffmann;K.R. Jayaram;Evangelia Kalyvianaki;Jeffrey O. Kephart;Philippe Lalanda;Ole Mengshoel;Arif Merchant;Aleksandar Milenkoski;Anders Robertsson;Felix Maximilian Roth;Xiaoyun Zhu</data>
