                    Juan Pablo Bello, Elaine Chew, and Meinard Müller
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://philpapers.org/go.pl?id=MCFEHS&amp;proxyId=&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fdx.doi.org%2F10.3389%2Ffpsyg.2017.01337; https://marl.smusic.nyu.edu/nieto/publications/MIREX2016-Nieto.pdf; http://www.isca-speech.org/archive/Interspeech_2016/abstracts/0083.html; https://18798-presscdn-pagely.netdna-ssl.com/ismir2016/wp-content/uploads/sites/2294/2016/07/043_Paper.pdf; http://m.mr-pc.org/ismir16/website/articles/135_Paper.pdf</data>
