                    Peter Bürgisser, Felipe Cucker, Marek Karpinski, and Nicolai Vorobjov
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.6.28</data>
      <data key="d10">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d11">Symbolic computation; algorithms in real algebraic geometry; complexity lower bounds; geometry of numerical algorithms</data>
