      <data key="d12">Burkhard Stiller;Georg Carle;Henning Schulzrinne;Jörg Ott;Markus Fiedler;Jürgen Schönwälder;Philip Eardley;Vaibhav Bajpai;Arthur W. Berger;Daniel Karrenberg;Mirja Kühlewind;Jukka Manner;Al Morton;Brian Trammell;Roland van Rijswijk-Deij;Oliver Hohlfeld;José Jair C. de Santanna;Renata Cruz Teixeira;Phillipa Gill;Steffie Jacob Eravuchira;Andri Lareida;Ian Robin Marsh;Colin Perkins;Philipp Richter;Varun Singh;Srikanth Sundaresan</data>
