      <data key="d12">Elisabeth André;Catherine Pelachaud;Michelle X. Zhou;Ana Paiva;Effie Lai-Chong Law;Björn Schuller;Cristina Conati;Jonathan Grudin;Laurence Devillers;Roger K. Moore;Dakuo Wang;Stefan Kopp;Leigh Clark;Minha Lee;Oliver Bendel;Asbjorn Folstad;Frode Guribye;Sebastian Hobert;Andreas Kilian;Dimosthenis Kontogiorgos;Matthias Kraus;Guy Laban;Clayton Lewis;Birthe Nesset;Martin Porcheron;Stefan Schaffer;Ryan Schuetzler;Eren Yildiz;Theo Araujo;Susan Brennan;Heloisa Candello;Ana Paula Chaves;Benjamin Cowan;Jasper Feine;Evelien Heyselaar;Soomin Kim;Yi-Chieh Lee;Oliver Lemon;Q. Vera Liao;Christine Liebrecht;Stefan Morana;Cosmin Munteanu;Symeon Papadopoulos;Caroline Peters;Rolf Pfister;Olivier Pietquin;Aleksandra Przegalinska;Elayne Ruane;Marita Skjuve;Cameron Taylor;Ricardo Usbeck;Margot van der Goot;Saskia Wita;Levi Witbaard;Zhou Yu</data>
