      <data key="d12">0; 0; 0</data>
      <data key="d13">Multi-agent systems; multi-agent programming; programming distributed systems; software methodologies for distributed systems; artificial intelligence / robotics; modelling / simulation; programming languages / compiler; semantics / specification / formal methods</data>
