                    Jon Crowcroft and Adam Wolisz and Arjuna Sathiaseelan
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00287-015-0885-x</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.11.78</data>
      <data key="d10">networks; society / human-computer interaction; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d11">Information Society; Information Access; Internet; Inclusion</data>
