      <data key="d12">Andreas Zeller;Lutz Prechelt;Dag Sjøberg;Tudor Girba;Robert Hirschfeld;Thomas Fritz;Kathryn T. Stolee;Gail C. Murphy;Hila Peleg;David C. Shepherd;Jun Kato;Michael Coblenz;Scott Fleming;Thomas D. LaToza;Moritz Beller;Amy Ko;Sebastian Baltes;Jonathan Bell;Gunnar Bergersen;Andrew Head;Brittany Johnson-Matthews;Sarah Lim;Justin Lubin;Francisco Servant;Justin Smith;Emma Söderberg;Jeffrey Stylos;Benjamin Xie</data>
