      <data key="d10">RiboNucleic Acids; Stuctural Design; Thermodynamics</data>
      <data key="d11">RiboNucleic Acids; Stuctural Design; Thermodynamics; Data Structures and Algorithms; Other Computer Science</data>
      <data key="d12">Christoph Flamm;Nicolas Schabanel;Sebastian Will;Marta Szachniuk;Yann Ponty;Shinnosuke Seki;Harold Fellermann;Petr Sulc;István Miklós;Sarah Berkemer;Christine Heitsch;Jan Gorodkin;Ebbe Sloth Andersen;Maciej Antczak;Stefan Badelt;Danny Barash;Anne Condon;Jorge Fernández de Cossío Díaz;Sven Findeiß;Cody Geary;Ivo Hofacker;Felix Kühnl;Philippe Nghe;Cyrille Merleau Nono Saha;Samuela Pasquali;Katja Petzold;Vladimir Reinharz;Lorenz Ronny;Frederic Runge;Bruno Sargueil;Andrew Torda;Maria Waldl;Hua-Ting Yao</data>
