                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Oliver Hohlfeld and Mohammad Alizadeh Attar and Jon Crowcroft and Lars Eggert and Klaus Wehrle
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/COMST.2017.2649687</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.7.15</data>
      <data key="d10">networks; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d11">Network architecture; data centres; latency; resource control; scheduling; end-to-end transport protocols.</data>
