<<<<<<< HEAD
                    Thomas Colcombet, Karin Quaas, and Michal Skrzypczak
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.10.57</data>
      <data key="d9">Computational Complexity; Formal Languages and Automata Theory; Logic in Computer Science</data>
      <data key="d10">Automata Theory; Unambiguity; Ambiguity; Determinism; Nondeterminism</data>
