                    Franz Dietrich and Ulle Endriss and Davide Grossi and Gabriella Pigozzi and Marija Slavkovik
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://pub.uni-bielefeld.de/download/2901599/2901600; http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.econlet.2016.12.012</data>
