      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">Graph Searching; Pursuit Evasion Games; Cop and Robber Games; AI/ robotics; data bases/ information retrieval; data structures/ algorithms/ complexity; hardware; modelling/simulation; networks; optimization/ scheduling; security/cryptography; verification/logic; WWW/internet; interdisciplinary</data>
