                    Dorothea Baumeister, Piotr Faliszewski, and Annick Laruelle
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/11478</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.7.6.109</data>
      <data key="d9">artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; modelling / simulation</data>
      <data key="d10">Social Choice; Artificial Intelligence; Multi Agent Systems; Collective Decision Making; Voting; Preference Aggregation; Preference Elicitation and Preference Learning</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Social Choice; Artificial Intelligence; Multi Agent Systems; Collective Decision Making; Voting; Preference Aggregation; Preference Elicitation and Preference Learning; artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; modelling / simulation</data>
      <data key="d12">Gerhard J. Woeginger;Judy Goldsmith;Toby Walsh;Jérôme Lang;Kristen Brent Venable;Jörg Rothe;Felix Brandt;Steven J. Brams;Marc Kilgour;Christian Klamler;Haris Aziz;Sylvain Bouveret;Edith Elkind;Ulle Endriss;Arkadii Slinko;William S. Zwicker;Markus Brill;Piotr Faliszewski;Jean-Francois Laslier;Vincent Merlin;Clemens Puppe;M. Remzi Sanver;Robert Bredereck;Jiehua Chen;Svetlana Obraztsova;Dorothea Baumeister;Annick Laruelle;Nicholas Mattei;Martin Lackner;William Bailey;Sirin Botan;Marcin Dziubinski;Bernard Grofman;Werner Kirsch;Andrea Loreggia;Stefan Napel;Dominik Peters;Lisa Rey;Ann-Kathrin Selker;Sujoy Sikdar;Piotr Skowron;Krzysztof Sornat;Nimrod Talmon</data>
