      <data key="d12">Alexander Wolff;Andreas Kerren;Michael Kaufmann;Stephen G. Kobourov;Sara Irina Fabrikant;Martin Nöllenburg;Silvia Miksch;Michael Wybrow;Yifan Hu;Kerstin Bunte;Wouter Meulemans;Peter Rodgers;Tamara Mchedlidze;Daniel Archambault;Sergey Pupyrev;Martin Krzywinski;Xiaoru Yuan;Radu Jianu;Luana Micallef;Robert Baker;Nan Cao;Thom Castermans;Fadi Dib;John Howse;Mereke van Garderen;Hsiang-Yun Wu</data>
