      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">constraint satisfaction problem (CSP); computational complexity; CSP dichotomy conjecture; hardness of approximation; unique games conjecture; parameterized complexity; descriptive complexity; universal algebra; logic; semidefinite programming; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Leslie Ann Goldberg;Mark R. Jerrum;Martin Grohe;Venkatesan Guruswami;Johan Hastad;Stefan Szeider;Andrei A. Bulatov;Victor Dalmau;Andrei Krokhin;Ryan O'Donnell;Dániel Marx;Manuel Bodirsky;Hubie Chen;Peter Jonsson;Isolde Adler;Barnaby Martin;Vladimir Kolmogorov;Eun Jung Kim;Dana Moshkovitz;Per Austrin;Marcin Kozik;Ross Willard;Stanislav Živný;Marcin Pilipczuk;Libor Barto;Yury Makarychev;Michael Pinsker;Johan Thapper;Yuichi Yoshida;Christoph Berkholz;Alexandr Kazda;Euiwoong Lee;Madhur Tulsiani;Dmitriy Zhuk;Victor Lagerqvist;Alexander Golovnev;Joshua Brakensiek;Clement Carbonnel;Peter Fulla;Michael Kompatscher;Antoine Mottet;Miroslav Olsak;Jakub Oprsal;Akbar Rafiey;Miguel Romero;Biman Roy;Tselil Schramm;Caterina Viola</data>
