      <data key="d11">group theory; circuit complexity; finite automata; algorithms on compressed structures; generic-case complexity; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Volker Diekert;Howard Straubing;Markus Lohrey;Manfred Kufleitner;Pascal Weil;Artur Jez;Igor Potapov;Vladimir Shpilrain;Yago Antolin;Laurent Bartholdi;Montserrat Casals-Ruiz;Laura Ciobanu;Jordi Delgado Rodriguez;Andrew Duncan;Bettina Eick;Murray Elder;Michal Ferov;Michael Figelius;Moses Ganardi;Albert Garreta Fontelles;Susan Hermiller;Ilya Kapovich;Ilya Kazachkov;Olga Kharlampovic;Alexei Myasnikov;Volodymyr Nekrashevych;Gretchen Ostheimer;Timothy Riley;Paul E. Schupp;Géraud Sénizergues;Rachel Skipper;Tatiana Smirnova-Nagnibeda;Benjamin Steinberg;Svetla Vassileva;Alina Vdovina;Enric Ventura Capell;Armin Weiß;Georg Zetzsche</data>
