                    Serge Fehr, Michele Mosca, Martin Roetteler, and Rainer Steinwandt
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.9.59</data>
      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d10">Quantum Computing; Post Quantum Cryptography; Computational Algebra; Cryptographic Protocol Design</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Quantum Computing; Post Quantum Cryptography; Computational Algebra; Cryptographic Protocol Design; data structures / algorithms / complexity; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d12">Daniel J. Bernstein;Johannes A. Buchmann;Miklos Santha;Peter Hoyer;Wim van Dam;Markus Grassl;Martin Roetteler;Louis Salvail;Tanja Lange;Stephen P. Jordan;Katalin Friedl;Serge Fehr;Alexander May;Christian Schaffner;Rainer Steinwandt;Michele Mosca;Andrew Childs;Stacey Jeffery;Kirill Morozov;Maris Ozols;Rolando Somma;Aleksandrs Belovs;Frédéric Dupont-Dupuis;Nadia Heninger;Gabor Ivanyos;Thijs Laarhoven;Bradley Lackey;Yi-Kai Liu;Youming Qiao;John M. Schanck;Nicolas Sendrier;Daniel C. Smith-Tone;Fang Song;Krysta Svore;Joop van de Pol;Maarten van den Nest;Frank K. Wilhelm</data>
