                    Maike Buchin, Luca Giuggioli, Guy Theraulaz, and Marc van Kreveld
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.3.138</data>
      <data key="d9">bioinformatics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; modelling / simulation</data>
      <data key="d10">trajectories; movement; data analysis; algorithms; collective motion; spatio-temporal data</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
