      <data key="d12">Jack Snoeyink;Bettina Speckmann;Marc van Kreveld;Carola Wenk;Matt Duckham;Patrick Laube;Roland Geraerts;Maarten Löffler;Yusu Wang;Ulf Blanke;Kevin Buchin;Maike Buchin;Ross Purves;Stefan van der Spek;Andrea Kölzsch;Ran Nathan;Edward A. Codling;Luca Giuggioli;Asja Jelic;Ugo Lopez;Ko Nishino;Nicholas Ouellette;Andrea Perna;Stef Sijben;Frank Staals;Greg J. Stephens;Guy Theraulaz;Gilles Tredan;Yossi Yovel</data>
