                    David Chisnall, Deepak Garg, Catalin Hritcu, and Mathias Payer
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.10.173</data>
      <data key="d9">programming languages / compiler; security / cryptology; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d10">secure compilation; low-level attacks; source-level reasoning; attacker models; full abstraction; hyperproperties; enforcement mechanisms; compartmentalization; security architectures; side-channels</data>
      <data key="d15">2</data>
      <data key="d11">secure compilation; low-level attacks; source-level reasoning; attacker models; full abstraction; hyperproperties; enforcement mechanisms; compartmentalization; security architectures; side-channels; programming languages / compiler; security / cryptology; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d12">Gilles Barthe;Zhong Shao;Mads Dam;Cédric Fournet;Andrew Myers;Peter Sewell;Jan Reineke;Amal Ahmed;Andreas Rossberg;Ingrid Verbauwhede;Chung-Kil Hur;Sandrine Blazy;Catalin Hritcu;Per Larsen;Deepak Garg;Santosh Nagarakatte;Roberto Blanco;Stefan Brunthaler;David Chisnall;Dominique Devriese;Akram El-Korashy;Toby Murray;Zoe Paraskevopoulou;Marco Patrignani;Deian Stefan;Marco Guarnieri;Matteo Busi;Anitha Gollamudi;Shweta Shinde;Jeremy Thibault;Thomas Van Strydonck;Arthur Azevedo de Amorim;Joseph Bialek;Nathan Burow;Ergys Dona;Tal Garfinkel;Jérémie Koenig;Amit Levy;Elisabeth Oswald;Mathias Payer;Kostya Serebryany;Gang Tan;Nikos Vasilakis;Marco Vassena;Drew Zagieboylo</data>
