                    Maristella Agosti, Norbert Fuhr, Elaine Toms, and Pertti Vakkari
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1145/2641383.2641390; https://doi.org/10.1145/2854946.2886106</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.10.92</data>
      <data key="d9">data bases / information retrieval</data>
      <data key="d10">Evaluation design; evaluation analysis; test collections; lab experiments; living labs</data>
      <data key="d11">Evaluation design; evaluation analysis; test collections; lab experiments; living labs; data bases / information retrieval</data>
      <data key="d12">Norbert Fuhr;Christa Womser-Hacker;Arjen P. de Vries;Matthias Hagen;Jaap Kamps;Maristella Agosti;Nicholas J. Belkin;Ann Blandford;Kalervo Järvelin;Noriko Kando;Diane Kelly;Ragnar Nordlie;Pertti Vakkari;C .J. Keith van Rijsbergen;Leif Azzopardi;Omar Alonso;Charles Clarke;Maarten de Rijke;Floriana Esposito;Nicola Ferro;Luanne Freund;Jacek Gwizdka;Preben Hansen;Jiyin He;Hideo Joho;Evangelos Kanoulas;Birger Larsen;Dirk Lewandowski;Christina Lioma;Thomas Mandl;Peter Mutschke;Heather O'Brien;Doug Oard;Vivien Petras;Martin Potthast;Soo Young Rieh;Gianmaria Silvello;Paul Thomas;Elaine Toms;Tuan Vu Tran;Robert Villa;Max L. Wilson</data>
