      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Graph drawing; geometric algorithms; combinatorial geometry; graph algorithms; graph theory; network visualization; data structures / algorithms / complexity; networks</data>
      <data key="d12">Günter Rote;Alexander Wolff;Peter Eades;Michael Kaufmann;Stephen G. Kobourov;Giuseppe Liotta;Michael Hoffmann;Seok-Hee Hong;Anna Lubiw;Maurizio Patrignani;Martin Nöllenburg;János Pach;Yoshio Okamoto;Stefan Felsner;Ignaz Rutter;Tamara Mchedlidze;Fabrizio Frati;Martin Gronemann;Sergey Pupyrev;Torsten Ueckerdt;Csaba Tóth;Patrizio Angelini;Michael A. Bekos;Giordano Da Lozzo;Fabrizio Montecchiani;Chrysanthi Raftopoulou;Géza Tóth;Linda Kleist;Eyal Ackerman;Carlos Alegría Galicia;María del Pilar Cano Vila;Vida Dujmovic;Henry Förster;Radoslav Fulek;Balázs Keszegh;Leonie Ryvkin</data>
