                    Hans L. Bodlaender, Pinar Heggernes, and Daniel Lokshtanov
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://doi.ieeecomputersociety.org/10.1109/FOCS.2014.37; http://arxiv.org/pdf/1306.6593v2</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.2.38</data>
      <data key="d10">Graph classes; parameterized algorithms; exact exponential time algorithms; graph embedding; graph editing</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Graph classes; parameterized algorithms; exact exponential time algorithms; graph embedding; graph editing; </data>
      <data key="d12">Haiko Müller;Andreas Brandstädt;Derek G. Corneil;Martin Charles Golumbic;Dieter Kratsch;Van Bang Le;Christophe Paul;Henning Fernau;Rolf Niedermeier;Andrzej Proskurowski;Fedor V. Fomin;Bart Jansen;Dimitrios M. Thilikos;Daniel Paulusma;Hans L. Bodlaender;Dieter B. Rautenbach;Dániel Marx;Erik Jan van Leeuwen;Pinar Heggernes;Isolde Adler;Saket Saurabh;Eun Jung Kim;Stefan Kratsch;Daniel Lokshtanov;Martin Milanic;Marek Cygan;Daniel Meister;Petr A. Golovach;Tinaz Ekim;Charis Papadopoulos;Pim van 't Hof;Archontia C. Giannopoulou;Neeldhara Misra;Marcin Pilipczuk;Michal Pilipczuk;Alexander Grigoriev;Mamadou Moustapha Kanté;O-joung Kwon;Rémy Belmonte;Yixin Cao;Paul Medvedev;George B. Mertzios;André Nichterlein;Kristina Vuskovic</data>
