                    Tatiana von Landesberger and Fintan McGee
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://www.diva-portal.org/smash/get/diva2:1340974/FULLTEXT01.pdf; https://www.multilayernetvis.org/fileadmin/files/McGee2019LayerDefinintionAndDiscovery.pdf; https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.01534; https://doi.org/10.2200/S01094ED1V01Y202104VIS012</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.9.2.1</data>
      <data key="d9">data structures / algorithms / complexity; society / human-computer interaction</data>
