      <data key="d11">Multilayer Network Visualization; Complex Systems; Graph Visualization; Visual Analytics; Social Network Analysis; Biological Networks; Geographic Networks; data structures / algorithms / complexity; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Andreas Kerren;Stephen G. Kobourov;Helen C. Purchase;Jean-Daniel Fekete;Guy Melançon;Michael Wybrow;Fabian Beck;Nathalie Henry Riche;Jessie Kennedy;Margit Pohl;Daniel Archambault;Jan Aerts;Tatiana von Landesberger;Björn Zimmer;Christian Tominski;Remco Chang;Kathrin Ballweg;Fintan McGee;Bruno Pinaud;Marten Düring;Ariful Azad;Alberto Cottica;Mohammad Ghoniem;Martin Grandjean;Mikko Kivelä;Søren Knudsen;Sylvain Legay;Matteo Magnani;Maria Malek;Mark McCann;Anders Kristian Munk;Benjamin Renoust;Arnaud Sallaberry;Blaž Škrlj;Paola Valdivia;Jason Vallet</data>
