                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Bernhard Burgeth, Ingrid Hotz, Anna Vilanova, and Carl-Fredrik Westin
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://www.springer.com/de/book/9783319150895</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.2.110</data>
      <data key="d9">bioinformatics; computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d10">visualization; image processing; tensor fields; diffusion tensor imaging; high angular resolution diffusion imaging (HARDI); data analysis; feature extraction; fiber tracking; structural mechanics; fluid dynamics</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">visualization; image processing; tensor fields; diffusion tensor imaging; high angular resolution diffusion imaging (HARDI); data analysis; feature extraction; fiber tracking; structural mechanics; fluid dynamics; bioinformatics; computer graphics / computer vision</data>
      <data key="d12">Hans Hagen;Jos B.T.M. Roerdink;Ingrid Hotz;Gerik Scheuermann;Nir Sochen;Bernhard Burgeth;Evren Özarslan;Ofer Pasternak;Anna Vilanova;Carl-Fredrik Westin;Thomas Schultz;Christoph Garth;Cagatay Demiralp;Hans Knutsson;Georgeta Elisabeta Marai;Rodrigo Moreno;Eugene Zhang;Luc Florack;Andrea Fuster;Lauren O'Donnell;Markus Stommel;Guoning Chen;Tom Dela Haije;Max Langbein;Renato Pajarola;Marc Schöneich</data>
