      <data key="d12">Elisabeth André;Peter I. Cowling;Ana Paiva;Marc Erich Latoschik;Simon Colton;Alex J. Champandard;Pier Luca Lanzi;Simon M. Lucas;Mirjam Palosaari Eladhari;Mike Preuß;Pieter Spronck;Tommy Thompson;Julian Togelius;Georgios N. Yannakakis;R. Michael Young;Dan Ashlock;Rafael Bidarra;Michael Cook;Antonios Liapis;Joshua Allen McCoy;Mark J. Nelson;Spyridon Samothrakis;Adam M. Smith;Gillian Smith;Michael Treanor;Jichen Zhu;Sander C.J. Bakkes;Cameron Browne;Steve Dahlskog;Reynald Francois;Matthew J. Guzdial;Amy K. Hoover;Jialin Liu;Alexander Nareyek;Diego Perez Liebana;Sebastian Risi;Jacob Schrum;Emily Short;Anne Sullivan;Shoshannah Tekofsky;David Thue;Vanessa Volz;G. Michael Youngblood</data>
