      <data key="d11">computable analysis; reliable numerical computation; complexity of real computation; floating-point arithmetic; exact real arithmetic; data structures / algorithms / complexity; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Chee K. Yap;Wolfram Luther;Andrej Bauer;Jens Blanck;Peter Hertling;Michal Konecny;Margarita Korovina;Norbert T. Müller;Robert Rettinger;Matthias Schröder;Klaus Weihrauch;Martin Ziegler;George F. Corliss;Tibor Csendes;Vladik Kreinovich;Michael Plum;Siegfried M. Rump;Fabrice Rouiller;Joris van der Hoeven;Henning Behnke;Stef Graillat;Mitsuhiro T. Nakao;Nobito Yamamoto;Paul Zimmermann;Michael Sagraloff;Florian Bünger;Katsuhisa Ozaki;Akitoshi Kawamura;Svetlana Selivanova;Eva Darulova;Eike Neumann;Franz Brauße;Pieter Collins;Hubert Glesener;Daniel Graca;Fabian Immler;Luc Jaulin;Sunyoung Kim;Ivo List;Fritz Mayer-Lindenberg;Atsushi Minamihata;Sewon Park;Amaury Pouly;Florian Steinberg;Akitoshi Takayasu;Holger Thies;Warwick Tucker;Yuuka Yanagisawa</data>
