      <data key="d12">Alessandro Cimatti;Joshua Berdine;Thomas W. Reps;Hongseok Yang;Sanjit A. Seshia;Martin Brain;Ruzica Piskac;Antoine Miné;Daniel Kroening;Thomas Wies;Akash Lal;Peter Schrammel;Alberto Griggio;Michel Rueher;Jörg Brauer;Aditya Thakur;Florian Zuleger;Arie Gurfinkel;Aws Albarghouthi;Vijay D'Silva;Bruno Dutertre;Julien Henry;Jacob Howe;Blanc Regis;Rahul Sharma;Rohit Sinha;Charlotte Truchet</data>
