      <data key="d12">Deepak Kapur;Christopher Lynch;Robert Nieuwenhuis;Andrei Voronkov;David Monniaux;Christoph Flamm;Joao Marques-Silva;Joshua Berdine;Albert Rubio;Helmut Veith;Laura Kovács;Albert Oliveras;Ruzica Piskac;Enric Rodríguez-Carbonell;Viorica Sofronie-Stokkermans;Silvio Ghilardi;Thomas Wies;Nikolaj S. Bjørner;Krystof Hoder;Vijay Ganesh;Sicun Gao;Feifei Ma;Christoph M. Wintersteiger;Jian Zhang;Ting Zhang</data>
