      <data key="d12">Vitaly Shmatikov;Satoru Miyano;Gene Tsudik;Jean-Jacques Quisquater;Bradley Malin;Florian Kerschbaum;Emiliano De Cristofaro;Jean Pierre Hubaux;Urs Hengartner;Gergely Acs;Erman Ayday;Marina Blanton;Jurgi Camblong;Zekeriya Erkin;Sky Faber;Jacques Fellay;Kay Hamacher;Zhicong Huang;Mathias Humbert;Murat Kantarcioglu;Regine Kollek;Klaus A. Kuhn;Reginald Lagendijk;Srdan Marinovic;Andrzej Mizera;Muhammad Naveed;Andreas Peter;Jean-Louis Raisaro;Roded Sharan;Amalio Telenti;Xiao Feng Wang</data>
