<<<<<<< HEAD
                    Nikolaj S. Bjørner, Nate Foster, Philip Brighten Godfrey, and Pamela Zave
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.2.44</data>
      <data key="d9">networks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">Networks; Formal Methods</data>
      <data key="d11">Networks; Formal Methods; networks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Stefan Schmid;Burkhart Wolff;Shriram Krishnamurthi;Mooly Sagiv;Andrey Rybalchenko;Timothy Roscoe;David Walker;Bryan Ford;Nikolaj S. Bjørner;David Rosenblum;Vijay Ganesh;Nate Foster;Arjun Guha;Swarat Chaudhuri;Arie Gurfinkel;Achim D. Brucker;Philip Brighten Godfrey;Panagiotis Papadimitriou;Ethan Katz-Bassett;Limin Jia;Pamela Zave;Aditya Akella;Marco Canini;Pavol Cerny;Evgeny Chemeritskiy;Shiu-Kai Chin;Aaron Gember-Jacobson;Karthick Jayaraman;Ori Lahav;Nuno Lopes;Ratul Mahajan;Tim Nelson;Aurojit Panda;Mark Reitblatt;Jennifer Rexford;Kristin Yvonne Rozier;Cole Schlesinger;Sharon Shoham Buchbinder;Robert Soulé;Alexander L. Wolf;Yifei Yuan;Vladimir Zakharov</data>
