      <data key="d12">Eran Yahav;David White;Luc De Raedt;Stephen H. Muggleton;Ruzica Piskac;Armando Solar-Lezama;Sumit Gulwani;Ute Schmid;Marco Ragni;Janis Voigtländer;Frank Jäkel;Mark Marron;Umair Zafrulla Ahmed;Sam Bayless;Tarek Richard Besold;Eyal Dechter;Alexey Grigoryev;Mike Hansen;Robert Henderson;José Hernández-Orallo;Petra Hofstedt;Susumu Katayama;Dileep Kini;Emanuel Kitzelmann;Fernando Martinez-Plumed;Martin Möhrmann;Daniel Perelman;Iurii Perov;Alex Polozov;George M. Sergievsky;Michael Siebers;Rishabh Singh;Benjamin Zorn</data>
