      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/TVCG.2019.2934541; https://diglib.eg.org/bitstream/handle/10.2312/eurova20191120/025-029.pdf?sequence=1&amp;isAllowed=y; https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.08032; https://diglib.eg.org/handle/10.2312/evs20191164</data>
