      <data key="d13">Hardware/Software Co-Design; Nanoelectronics; Emerging Post-CMOS Circuit Materials and Technologies; Heterogeneous Hardware; System Architecture; Operating Systems; Runtime Support; Compilers; Programming Languages; Formal Methods; hardware; operating systems; programming languages / compiler</data>
