      <data key="d12">Alberto Marchetti-Spaccamela;Kirk Pruhs;Christian Ferdinand;Dirk Ziegenbein;Wang Yi;Sebastian Altmeyer;Jan Reineke;James H. Anderson;Sanjoy Baruah;Enrico Bini;Alan Burns;Liliana Cucu-Grosjean;Robert Davis;Arvind Easwaran;Sathish Gopalakrishnan;Sascha Uhrig;Martina Maggio;Björn B. Brandenburg;Pontus Ekberg;Sébastien Faucou;Adriana Gogonel;Emmanuel Grolleau;Zhishan Guo;Leandro Soares Indrusiak;Cristian Maxim;Dorin Maxim;Zoë Stephenson;Jian-Jia Chen;Kunal Agrawal;Iain Bate;Thidapat (Tam) Chantem;Madeleine Faugère;Laurent George;Jaewoo Lee;Jing Li;Mitra Nasri;Claire Pagetti;Gurulingesh Raravi;Stefan Resch;Philippa Ryan;Luca Santinelli</data>
