      <data key="d12">David Chaum;Bart Preneel;Berry Schoenmakers;Mark D. Ryan;Miroslaw Kutylowski;Michael Clarkson;Peter Y. A. Ryan;Steve Schneider;Joseph Roland Kiniry;Michael Alvarez;Josh Benaloh;Ian Brown;Olivier de Marneffe;Stéphanie Delaune;Rop Gonggrijp;J. Alex Halderman;Benjamin Hosp;Catsumi Imamura;Rui Joaquim;John Kelsey;Aggelos Kiayias;Robert Krimmer;Przemyslaw Kubiak;David Lundin;Tal Moran;Olivier Pereira;Stefan Popoveniuc;Jean-Jacques Quisquater;Ronald L. Rivest;Michael Roe;Kazue Sako;Roberto Samarone Araujo;Bruno Simeone;Ben Smyth;Vanessa Teague;Jacques Traoré;Melanie Volkamer;Poorvi Vora;Dan Wallach;Filip Zagórski</data>
