Berger. Towards a better understanding of software features and their characteristics: A
case study of Marlin. In VaMoS, 2018.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Vincent J. Kruskal. Managing multi-version programs with an editor. IBM Journal of
Research and Development, 28(1):74–81, 1984.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Philip Langer, Manuel Wimmer, Petra Brosch, Markus Herrmannsdörfer, Martina Seidl,
