&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Stephen A. MacKay. The state of the art in concurrent, distributed configuration management.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 Axel Mahler. Configuration management. Chapter Variants: Keeping Things Together and
