                    Sanjoy Baruah, Liliana Cucu-Grosjean, Robert Davis, and Claire Maiza
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.3.84</data>
      <data key="d9">networks; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d10">Real-Time Systems; Mixed Criticality; Multicore; Manycore; Scheduling; Schedulability Analysis; Timing Analysis; Network-on-Chip; Memory Architectures; Worst-Case Execution time; Real-Time Operating Systems</data>
      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">Real-Time Systems; Mixed Criticality; Multicore; Manycore; Scheduling; Schedulability Analysis; Timing Analysis; Network-on-Chip; Memory Architectures; Worst-Case Execution time; Real-Time Operating Systems; networks; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Alberto Marchetti-Spaccamela;Rolf Ernst;Lothar Thiele;Leen Stougie;Albert Cohen;Christine Rochange;Wang Yi;Sebastian Stiller;Sebastian Altmeyer;Jan Reineke;Roman Obermaisser;James H. Anderson;Sanjoy Baruah;Enrico Bini;Alan Burns;Liliana Cucu-Grosjean;Gerhard Fohler;Sophie Quinton;Marko Bertogna;Robert Davis;Arvind Easwaran;Nathan Fisher;Joel Goossens;Suzanne Den Hertog;David Broman;Kai Lampka;Björn Lisper;Yasmina Abdeddaim;Björn B. Brandenburg;Pontus Ekberg;Sébastien Faucou;Chris Gill;Adriana Gogonel;Emmanuel Grolleau;Zhishan Guo;Pengcheng Huang;Leandro Soares Indrusiak;Claire Maiza;Cristian Maxim;Dorin Maxim;Vincent Nelis;Gabriel Parmer;Pascal Richard;Zoë Stephenson</data>
