      <data key="d11">program analysis; abstract interpretation; abstract domain; fixed-point finding; satisfiability checking; satisfiability modulo theories; decision procedures</data>
      <data key="d13">program analysis; abstract interpretation; abstract domain; fixed-point finding; satisfiability checking; satisfiability modulo theories; decision procedures; programming languages / compiler; verification / logic</data>
