      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.7.7.1</data>
      <data key="d9">hardware; mobile computing; networks</data>
      <data key="d10">wireless networks</data>
      <data key="d11">wireless networks; hardware; mobile computing; networks</data>
      <data key="d12">Anja Feldmann;Christian Scheideler;Christian Schindelhauer;Roger Wattenhofer;Jörg Widmer;Seth Gilbert;Michele Zorzi;Magnús M. Halldórsson;Holger Karl;Emina Soljanin;Muriel Médard;Martin Haenggi;Tomasz Jurdzinski;Bhaskar Krishnamachari;Fabian Daniel Kuhn;Longbo Huang;Michelle Effros;Christina Fragouli;Giuseppe Caire;Izzat Darwazeh;Deniz Gündüz;Kyle Jamieson;Christina Kolb;Konstantinos Nikitopoulos;Vijay Subramanian;Patrick Thiran;Tigran Tonoyan;Daniela Tuninetti;Elif Uysal-Biyikoglu;Zhiying Wang;Dongxiao Yu;Marco Antonio Zúñiga Zamalloa</data>
