      <data key="d11">infinite games with perfect information; reactive systems; specification and verification; combinatorics; hierarchies and reducibilities; data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic; automata theory; Ehrenfeucht-Fra¨ýss´e games and Gale-Stewart games</data>
      <data key="d12">Dietrich Kuske;Thomas Schwentick;Zoltan Esik;Wolfgang Thomas;Thomas Wilke;Luc Segoufin;Victor Selivanov;Ludwig Staiger;Julian Bradfield;Markus Holzer;Pierre McKenzie;Nicole Schweikardt;Dietmar Berwanger;Jacques Duparc;Christof Löding;Damian Niwinski;Volker Diekert;Serge Grigorieff;Alexander Rabinovich;Manfred Droste;Bill Wadge;Howard Straubing;Christian Glasser;Olivier Carton;Thomas Colcombet;Markus Lohrey;Jean-Eric Pin;Paul Gastin;Jacques Sakarovitch;André Hernich;Bahareh Afshari;Marie-Pierre Béal;André Böhm;Véronique Bruyère;Christian Choffrut;Juhani Karhumäki;Manfred Kufleitner;Alexander Okhotin;Friedrich Otto;Yann Pequignot;Christian Reitwießner;Heinz Schmitz;Pascal Weil;Ludmila Yartseva</data>
