                    Lars Birkedal, Derek Dreyer, Philippa Gardner, and Zhong Shao
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jlamp.2016.01.002</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.5.5.1</data>
      <data key="d9">programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">concurrency; compositional verification; mutable state; program logics; semantics; type systems; weak memory models; higher-order programming</data>
      <data key="d11">concurrency; compositional verification; mutable state; program logics; semantics; type systems; weak memory models; higher-order programming; programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Zhong Shao;Philippa Gardner;Bart Jacobs;Cliff B. Jones;Nobuko Yoshida;Francois Pottier;Noam Rinetzky;Peter Sewell;Shaz Qadeer;Peter Müller;Jan Hoffmann;Lennart Beringer;Lars Birkedal;Neel Krishnaswami;Aleksandar Nanevski;Maged M. Michael;Alexey Gotsman;Viktor Vafeiadis;Martin Vechev;Adam Chlipala;Derek Dreyer;Aquinas Hobor;Chung-Kil Hur;Kasper Svendsen;Mike Dodds;Paul McKenney;Scott Owens;Alastair F. Donaldson;Ori Lahav;Andrea Cerone;Karl Crary;Pedro Da Rocha  Pinto;Thomas Dinsdale-Young;Cezara Dragoi;Xinyu Feng;Ralf Jung;Eric Koskinen;Hongjin Liang;Kyndylan Nienhuis;Frank Pfenning;Jean Pichon-Pharabod;Azalea Raad;John Reppy;Claudio Russo;Ilya Sergey;Joseph Tassarotti</data>
