                    Ulrich Carsten Meyer, Henning Meyerhenke, Ali Pinar, and Ilya Safro
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.11.40</data>
      <data key="d9">data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity; networks</data>
      <data key="d10">(Hyper)Graph and network algorithms; high-performance computing; massive network analytics; parallel algorithmic machine models; graph-based computational applications</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">(Hyper)Graph and network algorithms; high-performance computing; massive network analytics; parallel algorithmic machine models; graph-based computational applications; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity; networks</data>
      <data key="d12">Petra Mutzel;Ulrich Carsten Meyer;Friedhelm Meyer auf der Heide;Peter Sanders;Anand Srivastav;Jesper Larsson Träff;Deepak Ajwani;Sivan Toledo;Andrew Lumsdaine;Henning Meyerhenke;Bora Uçar;Rob Bisseling;Erik Boman;Ümit V. Çatalyürek;Fredrik Manne;Francois Pellegrini;Ali Pinar;Alex Pothen;Ilya Safro;Katharina A. Zweig;Srinivasan Parthasarathy;Aydin Buluc;Elisabetta Bergamini;Christian Brugger;Deepayan Chakrabarti;Tiago de Paula Peixoto;Yann Disser;John Feo;Enver Kayaaslan;Dominique LaSalle;Kamesh Madduri;Aleksander Madry;Benjamin A. Miller;Braxton Osting;Christian Schulz;Christian Staudt;Veronika Strnadova;Panayot S. Vassilevski;David Veith</data>
