                    Alessandro Acquisti, Ioannis Krontiris, Marc Langheinrich, and Martina Angela Sasse
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/MCOM.2014.6871669</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.7.74</data>
      <data key="d10">security / cryptology; society / human-computer interaction; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d11">Privacy; data loss prevention; informational self-determination; Web 2.0; mobile Internet</data>
