&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Douglas R. Smith. The synthesis of LISP programs from examples: A survey. In Automatic
Program Construction Techniques, pages 307–324. Macmillan, 1984.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; J. Tenenbaum, T.L. Griffiths, and C. Kemp. Theory-based Bayesian models of inductive
learning and reasoning. Trends in Cognitive Sciences, 10(7):309–318, 2006.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Christina Zeller and Ute Schmid. Automatic generation of analogous problems to help resolving misconceptions in an intelligent tutor system for written subtraction. In Proceedings of the Workshop on Computational Analogy at the 24th International Conference on Case Based Reasoning (ICCBR 2016, Atlanta, GA, 31th October to 2nd November 2016), 2016.
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
