                    Ute Schmid and Luc De Raedt
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.06410; https://doi.org/10.1007/s10994-021-06048-w; https://doi.org/10.1093/oso/9780198862536.003.0017</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.9.5.58</data>
