      <data key="d10">persistent memory; non-volatile memory; SSD; database systems; storage</data>
      <data key="d11">persistent memory; non-volatile memory; SSD; database systems; storage; Data Structures and Algorithms; Databases; Performance</data>
      <data key="d12">Ulrich Carsten Meyer;Wolfgang Lehner;Kai-Uwe Sattler;Wolfgang Schröder-Preikschat;Gustavo Alonso;Peter A. Boncz;Goetz Graefe;Jens Teubner;Alexander Böhm;Thomas Neumann;Stratos Idreos;Alfons Kemper;Ken Salem;Margo Seltzer;André Brinkmann;Marcos K. Aguilera;Khuzaima Daudjee;Carsten Binnig;Viktor Leis;Jana Giceva;Danica Porobic;Tianzheng Wang;Alberto Lerner;Alexander Baumstark;Christian Dietrich;Muhammad Attahir Jibril;Marcus Paradies;Alexander van Renen;Raja Appuswamy;Manos Athanassoulis;Mark Callaghan;Gabriel Haas;Ismail Oukid;William Wang</data>
