                    Julian Dolby, Orna Grumberg, Peter Müller, and Omer Tripp
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.5.56</data>
      <data key="d9">programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d10">Concurrency; testing; program analysis; program verification; model checking; program repair; fault localization</data>
      <data key="d11">Concurrency; testing; program analysis; program verification; model checking; program repair; fault localization; programming languages / compiler; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Philippa Gardner;Natasha Sharygina;Cliff B. Jones;Julian Dolby;Anders Møller;Wolfgang J. Paul;Arnd Poetzsch-Heffter;Ben Liblit;Peter Müller;K. Rustan M. Leino;Derek Dreyer;Mike Dodds;Andreas Lochbihler;Arie Gurfinkel;Michael Tautschnig;Caterina Urban;Sharon Shoham Buchbinder;Ilya Sergey;Orna Grumberg;Wytse Oortwijn;Corina Pasareanu;Murali Krishna Ramanathan;Malavika Samak;Alexander J. Summers;Omer Tripp;Yakir Vizel;Thomas Wahl</data>
