                    Rui Aguiar, Artur Hecker, Stefan Schmid, and Henning Schulzrinne
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">Networking and Internet Architecture</data>
      <data key="d10">software-defined networking; self-driving networks; automation; machine learning</data>
      <data key="d11">software-defined networking; self-driving networks; automation; machine learning; Networking and Internet Architecture</data>
      <data key="d12">Georg Carle;Stefan Schmid;Martina Zitterbart;Roland Bless;Henning Schulzrinne;Karin Anna Hummel;Cigdem Sengul;Chen Avin;Artur Hecker;Dario Rossi;Fabien Geyer;Gabriel Scalosub;Klaus-Tycho Foerster;David Hay;Gianni Antichi;Gábor Rétvári;Sergey Gorinsky;Lily Hügerich;Sándor Laki;Shir Landau Feibish;Huiran Liu;Iosif Salem;Rui Aguiar</data>
