                    Oliver Hohlfeld and Mohammad Alizadeh Attar and Jon Crowcroft and Lars Eggert and Klaus Wehrle
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/COMST.2017.2649687</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.7.15</data>
      <data key="d9">networks; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d10">Network architecture; data centres; latency; resource control; scheduling; end-to-end transport protocols.</data>
      <data key="d11">Network architecture; data centres; latency; resource control; scheduling; end-to-end transport protocols.; networks; operating systems; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Klaus Wehrle;Wolfgang Kellerer;Julian Chesterfield;Lars Eggert;Jari Arkko;Bob Briscoe;Jon Crowcroft;Michael Scharf;Patrick Thomas Eugster;Andrew W. Moore;Mirja Kühlewind;Michael Welzl;Marco Canini;Oliver Hohlfeld;Matthew P. Grosvenor;Noa Zilberman;Alexandru Agache;Mohammad Alizadeh Attar;Marinho Barcellos;Olivier Bonaventure;Edouard Bugnion;Mosharaf Chowdhury;Koen De Schepper;Aaron Ding;Nandita Dukkipati;Dongsu Han;Michio Honda;Patrick Jahnke;Lavanya Jose;Kirill Kogan;Mike Marty;John Ousterhout;Jitendra Padhye;Rong Pan;Max Plauth;Ihsan Ayyub Qazi;Costin Raiciu;Hakim Weatherspoon</data>
