      <data key="d12">Leopoldo Bertossi;David Toman;Ian Horrocks;Franz Baader;Diego Calvanese;Leon van der Torre;Emil Weydert;Robert A. Meersman;Piero Andrea Bonatti;Thomas Eiter;Kewen Wang;James P. Delgrande;Peter F. Patel-Schneider;Riccardo Rosati;Gabriele Kern-Isberner;Marcelo Arenas;Alexander Bochman;Eduardo Fermé;Andreas Herzig;Thomas Meyer;Stefan Schlobach;Carsten Lutz;Uli Sattler;Frank Wolter;Jeff Z. Pan;Meghyn Bienvenu;Aaron M. Hunter;Renata Wassermann;David Carral;Giovanni Casini;Giorgos Flouris;Laura Giordano;Birte Glimm;Ryutaro Ichise;Marcel Lippmann;Rafael Penaloza;Marcio Moretto Ribeiro;Matthias Thimm;Ivan José Varzinczak;Zhe Wang;Grant Weddell</data>
=======
                    Falko Dressler, Ana Aguiar, Onur Altintas, and Gunnar Karlsson
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/MNET.001.2100491</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.5.89</data>
