      <data key="d11">Bioinformatics; cheminformatics; computational metabolomics; computational mass spectrometry; algorithms; databases; bioinformatics</data>
      <data key="d12">Juho Rousu;David Wishart;Oliver Kohlbacher;Steffen Neumann;Sebastian Böcker;Nuno Bandeira;Nicola Zamboni;Felicity Allen;Corey Broeckling;Celine Brouard;Jacques Corbeil;Pieter Dorrestein;Kai Dührkop;P. Lee Ferguson;Franziska Hufsky;Gabi Kastenmüller;Tobias Kind;Daniel Krug;Kris Morreel;Tomas Pluskal;Lars Ridder;Simon Rogers;Emma Schymanski;Huibin Shen;Christoph Steinbeck;Michael Andrej Stravs;Ales Svatos;Tom Wenseleers;Rohan Williams;Michael Anton Witting;Gert Wohlgemuth;Oliver Fiehn</data>
