      <data key="d11">sparse signal representation; optimal signal reconstruction; approximation; compression; data bases; information retrieval; data structures; algorithms; complexity; sparse signal representation; signal reconstruction; signal compression</data>
      <data key="d12">Stephan Dahlke;Erich Novak;Winfried Sickel;Vladimir N. Temlyakov;Gabriele Steidl;Alfred M. Bruckstein;Nir Sochen;Przemyslaw Wojtaszczyk;Martin J. Strauss;Thorsten Raasch;Rob Stevenson;Kai Bittner;Wolfgang Dahmen;Monika Dörfler;Martin Ehler;Michael Elad;Yonina C. Eldar;Hans Georg Feichtinger;Massimo Fornasier;Karlheinz Gröchenig;Onur G. Guleryuz;Bin Han;Rong-Qing Jia;Gitta Kutyniok;Peter Maaß;Stephane Mallat;Götz E. Pfander;Gerlind Plonka-Hoch;Holger Rauhut;Zuowei Shen;Joachim Stöckler;Thomas Strohmer;Anita Tabacco;Gerd Teschke;Bruno Torresani;Michael Zibulevsky;Ingrid Daubechies</data>
