                    Michael Kerber, Vijay Natarajan, and Bei Wang
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.14373; https://diglib.eg.org/handle/10.2312/envirvis20191100; http://www.informatik.uni-leipzig.de/~bujack/2019TopoInVis.pdf; https://cgl.ethz.ch/publications/papers/paperBuj19a.php; https://hal.inria.fr/hal-02569089/; https://doi.org/10.1111/cgf.14037</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.9.5.110</data>
      <data key="d10">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
