                    Benjamin Xie, Amy Ko, Thomas D. LaToza, David C. Shepherd, and Dag Sjøberg
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.12.6.1</data>
      <data key="d10">Human-Computer Interaction; Programming Languages; Software Engineering</data>
