                    Dirk Beyer, Marieke Huisman, Vladimir Klebanov, and Rosemary Monahan
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.4.1</data>
      <data key="d10">semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d11">Formal Verification; Model Checking; Deductive Verification; Competitions and Benchmarks</data>
      <data key="d13">Formal Verification; Model Checking; Deductive Verification; Competitions and Benchmarks; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
