                    Holger H. Hoos, Frank Neumann, and Heike Trautmann
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://aaai.org/ocs/index.php/AAAI/AAAI17/paper/view/14290; https://doi.org/10.1109/CEC.2017.7969507; https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-69404-7_8</data>
