                    Albert Atserias, Jakob Nordström, Pavel Pudlák, and Rahul Santhanam
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-94144-8_19; https://eccc.weizmann.ac.il/report/2018/102/</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.1.124</data>
      <data key="d10">data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic</data>
