                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Kira V. Adaricheva, Giuseppe F. Italiano, Hans Kleine Büning, and György Turan
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/journal/03043975/658/part/PB?sdc=2</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.5.1</data>
      <data key="d10">artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d11">Horn formulas; hypergraphs; closures; lattices; dependencies; formal concepts</data>
      <data key="d13">Horn formulas; hypergraphs; closures; lattices; dependencies; formal concepts; artificial intelligence / robotics; data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic</data>
