                    Valentine Kabanets, Thomas Thierauf, Jacobo Torán, and Christopher Umans
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-58741-7_13; https://arxiv.org/abs/1709.10063; https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.09652</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.6.10.13</data>
