&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stuart Kurkowski, Tracy Camp, and Michael Colagrosso. MANET Simulation Studies: The Incredibles. In Mobile Computing and Communications Review, pages 50–61, 2005. doi:10.1145/1096166.1096174.
