&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vaibhav Bajpai, Mirja Kühlewind, Jörg Ott, Jürgen Schönwälder, Anna Sperotto, and Brian Trammell. Challenges with Reproducibility. In SIGCOMM 2017 Reproducibility
