                    Erika Abraham, Alberto Avritzer, Anne Remke, and William H. Sanders
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.entcs.2014.12.010</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.1.36</data>
      <data key="d10">modelling / simulation; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d11">Critical Infrastructures; Smart Grids; Modeling; Randomized Timed and Hybrid Models; Analysis</data>
