                        Creative Commons BY 3.0 Unported license
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Manindra Agrawal, Valentine Kabanets, Thomas Thierauf, and Christopher Umans
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://cjtcs.cs.uchicago.edu/articles/2016/10/contents.html; https://doi.org/10.1007/s00037-016-0141-z; http://eccc.hpi-web.de/report/2014/122/download; https://doi.org/10.1007/s00037-016-0146-7; http://eccc.hpi-web.de/report/2013/140/download; http://dl.acm.org/ft_gateway.cfm?id=2591797&amp;ftid=1474399&amp;dwn=1&amp;CFID=627492956&amp;CFTOKEN=60251589; http://eccc.hpi-web.de/report/2014/104/download; http://dx.doi.org/10.1145/2746539.2746575; http://eccc.hpi-web.de/report/2014/180/download; http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00037-016-0124-0</data>
