                    Marc C. Dacier, Frank Kargl, Hartmut König, and Alfonso Valdes
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00287-014-0846-9; http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/MSP.2014.120</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.7.62</data>
      <data key="d10">networks; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d11">Security; Intrusion Detection; Critical Infrastructures; Industrial Control Systems; SCADA; Vulnerability Analysis; Malware Assessment; Attack Response and Countermeasures</data>
      <data key="d12">1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d13">Security; Intrusion Detection; Critical Infrastructures; Industrial Control Systems; SCADA; Vulnerability Analysis; Malware Assessment; Attack Response and Countermeasures; networks; security / cryptology</data>
