                    Ruedi Aebersold and Oliver Kohlbacher and Olga Vitek
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/pr501318d</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.12.1</data>
      <data key="d10">bioinformatics; data bases / information retrieval; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d11">Computational Mass Spectrometry; Proteomics; Metabolomics; Bioinformatics; Statistics</data>
      <data key="d12">1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
