      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.3.4.151</data>
      <data key="d10">artificial intelligence / robotics; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d11">Model checking; specification-based testing; multi-agent systems; controller synthesis; temporal logic</data>
