                        Creative Commons BY 4.0
                    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt; 
 &lt;div&gt;
&lt;img alt="Copyright" src="https://www.dagstuhl.de/_Resources/Static/Packages/Dagstuhl.Site/Frontend/images/licenses/copy.png?bust=22575bbf" style="width: 1em;"/&gt;

                    Martin Grohe, Stephan Günnemann, Stefanie Jegelka, and Christopher Morris
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.15117</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.12.3.141</data>
      <data key="d10">Discrete Mathematics; Machine Learning; Neural and Evolutionary Computing</data>
      <data key="d11">machine learning for graphs; graph embedding</data>
