                    Martin Hirzel, Tilmann Rabl, and Sherif Sakr
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/ICDE.2018.00169; http://hirzels.com/martin/papers/encyc18-cont-queries.pdf; https://doi.org/10.1145/3210284.3210294; https://doi.org/10.1145/3316416.3316426; http://hirzels.com/martin/papers/encyc18-stream-lang.pdf; https://sigmodrecord.org/publications/sigmodRecord/1806/pdfs/05_Surveys_Hirzel.pdf; http://hirzels.com/martin/papers/encyc18-stream-optim.pdf; https://doi.org/10.1145/3242153.3242155; https://doi.org/10.1109/Innovate-Data.2018.00009</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.7.10.111</data>
      <data key="d9">data bases / information retrieval; optimization / scheduling; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d10">Big Data; Big Streams; Stream Processing Systems; Benchmarking; Declarative Programming</data>
      <data key="d11">Big Data; Big Streams; Stream Processing Systems; Benchmarking; Declarative Programming; data bases / information retrieval; optimization / scheduling; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d12">Kai-Uwe Sattler;Manfred Hauswirth;Michael H. Böhlen;Hong-Linh Truong;Angela Bonifati;Martin Strohbach;Martin Hirzel;Ashish Gehani;Emanuele Della Valle;Alessandro Margara;Pramod Bhatotia;Sherif Sakr;Albert Bifet;Jean-Paul Calbimonte;Paris Carbone;Javier David Fernández-García;Günter Hesse;Ali Intizar;Asterios Katsifodimos;Nikos Katsipoulakis;Henning Kropp;Danh Le Phuoc;Gianmarco Morales;Christoph Quix;Tilmann Rabl;Matthias J. Sax;Akrivi Vlachou;Thomas Weise;Yongluan Zhou</data>
