<<<<<<< HEAD
                    Tijl De Bie, Luc De Raedt, Holger H. Hoos, and Padhraic Smyth
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.9.154</data>
      <data key="d9">artificial intelligence / robotics; data bases / information retrieval; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d10">data science; artificial intelligence; automated machine learning; automated scientific discovery; inductive programming</data>
      <data key="d11">data science; artificial intelligence; automated machine learning; automated scientific discovery; inductive programming; artificial intelligence / robotics; data bases / information retrieval; programming languages / compiler</data>
      <data key="d12">Christopher Williams;Kevin Leyton-Brown;Nada Lavrac;Hendrik Blockeel;Luc De Raedt;Peter Flach;Paolo Frasconi;Andrea Passerini;Marc Schoenauer;Michele Sebag;Michael R. Berthold;Elisa Fromont;Holger H. Hoos;Ute Schmid;Tijl De Bie;Siegfried Nijssen;Alexandre Termier;José Hernández-Orallo;Remco Chang;Frank Hutter;Lars Kotthoff;Joaquin Vanschoren;Heike Trautmann;Matteo Riondato;Leman Akoglu;Mitra Baratchi;Pavel Brazdil;Ray G. Butler;Felipe Leno da Silva;Tobias Jacobs;Jefrey Lijffijt;Zhengying Liu;María Pérez-Ortiz;Bernhard Pfahringer;Kai Puolamäki;Padhraic Smyth;Stefano Teso;Isabel Valera;Matthijs van Leeuwen;Jilles Vreeken;Andreas Wierse</data>
