      <data key="d11">Model checking; specification-based testing; multi-agent systems; controller synthesis; temporal logic; artificial intelligence / robotics; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Stephan Merz;Alessio R. Lomuscio;Ron van der Meyden;Yuri Gurevich;Karsten Wolf;Michael Fisher;Dimitar Guelev;Jean-Francois Raskin;Sylvain Peyronnet;Holger Schlingloff;Sophie Pinchinat;Guillaume Aucher;Andreas Herzig;Hans Van Ditmarsch;Wojtek Jamroga;Henning Schnoor;Thomas Agotnes;Valentin Goranko;Aniello Murano;Wojciech Penczek;Alexandru Baltag;Nils Bulling;Louise A. Dennis;Francois Laroussinie;Nicolas Markey;Francois Schwarzentruber;Ina Schaefer;Carlos Areces;Ezio Bartocci;Ioana Boureanu;Tim French;Stefan Gruner;Bastien Maubert;Jerzy Pilecki;Franco Raimondi;Markus Roggenbach;Gerardo Schneider;Dmitry Shkatov;Ramanathan Venkatesh</data>
