      <data key="d11">Software testing; test generation; test automation; test oracles; testing tools; humancomputer interaction; code-based testing; specification-based testing; model-based testing; sw-engineering; society / HCI; verification / logic; semantics / formal methods</data>
      <data key="d12">Wolfgang Grieskamp;Nikolai Tillmann;Jan Tretmans;Thomas Ball;Laura Dillon;Patrice Godefroid;Mary Jean Harrold;Darko Marinov;Willem Visser;Adam Porter;Mark Harman;Robert M. Hierons;Mauro Pezzè;A. J. Ko;David Schuler;Tao Xie;Wolfram Schulte;Yue Jia;Kiran Lakhotia;Leonardo Mariani;Henry Muccini;Andrea Polini;Nadia Alshahwan;Jamie Andrews;Antonia Bertolino;Gordon Fraser;Mark Grechanik;Eileen T. Kraemer;Yves Le Traon;Bruno Legeard;Stephen Oney;Amit Paradkar;John Penix;Brian P. Robinson;David Rosenblum;Per Runeson;Paolo Tonella;Michael W. Whalen;Shin Yoo;Michal Young</data>
