      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Organic Computing; Self-Organization; Trustworthy System Design; Adaptivity; artifical intelligence; robotics / data structures; algorithms; complexity / mobile computing / modelling; simulation / networks / semantics; formal methods / soft computing; evolutionary algorithms / software engineering / interdisciplinary</data>
      <data key="d12">Hartmut Schmeck;Michael Beigl;Christian Müller-Schloer;Jürgen Branke;Uwe Brinkschulte;Marco Platzner;Franz J. Rammig;Jürgen Teich;Kirstie Bellman;Andreas Herkersdorf;Chris Landauer;Falk Langhammer;Bernhard Sick;Rolf P. Würtz;Yuriy Brun;Paul Robertson;Jörg Hähner;Michael G. Hinchey;Robert Laddaga;Erik Maehle;Phyllis R. Nelson;Sven Brückner;Wolfgang Konen;Gabriele Peters;Ingo Scholtes;Emil Vassev;Laurenz Wiskott;Johannes Zeppenfeld;Junmei Zhu</data>
