      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">quantitative model checking; weighted automata; systems biology; energy grid; smart buildings; multicore platforms; modelling / simulation; semantics / formal methods; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Dietrich Kuske;Zoltan Esik;Javier Esparza;Axel Legay;Antonin Kucera;Jeremy Sproston;Jan Madsen;Gerard J. M. Smit;Sean Sedwards;Manfred Droste;Kim Guldstrand Larsen;Thomas Colcombet;Benedikt Bollig;Paul Gastin;Jan Kretinsky;Nicolas Markey;Karin Quaas;Jacques Sakarovitch;Rafael Wisniewski;Martin Riedl;Cristian Riveros;Ulrich Fahrenberg;Laurent Doyen;Emmanuel Filiot;Giorgio Bacci;Giovanni Bacci;Miroslav Ciric;Julie De Pril;Daniel Gebler;Cyrille Jegourel;Heinz Koeppl;Kai Lampka;Björn Lisper;Sylvain Lombardy;Benjamin Monmege;Vitaly Perevoshchikov;Tatjana Petrov;Christian Reidys;Bart Theelen;Thomas Weidner</data>
