      <data key="d12">Ulrich Furbach;John Stell;Stefania Costantini;Bertram Ludäscher;Anthony Cohn;Werner Kuhn;James Pustejovsky;Christian Freksa;Thora Tenbrink;Diedrich Wolter;Paulo E. Santos;Gabriel Zachmann;Sabine Timpf;Florentin Wörgötter;Shyamanta Moni Hazarika;Stefano Borgo;Pat Langley;Simon Scheider;David Kirsh;Pedro Cabalar;Zoe Falomir;Simon Dobnik;Gavin Duffy;Anna Foerster;Thiago Pedro Donadon Homem;Felix Kroll;Marcos Lopes;Chayanika Deka Nath;Ana-Maria Olteteanu;Marianna Pagkratidou;Adam Pease;Michael Sioutis;Kristin Stock;Maria Vasardani;Jago Williams</data>
