      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.11.9.64</data>
      <data key="d9">Cryptography and Security; Emerging Technologies</data>
      <data key="d10">quantum computing; post-quantum cryptography; quantum resource estimation; computational algebra</data>
      <data key="d15">2; 2; 2; 2; 2; 2</data>
      <data key="d11">quantum computing; post-quantum cryptography; quantum resource estimation; computational algebra; Cryptography and Security; Emerging Technologies</data>
      <data key="d12">Daniel J. Bernstein;Claus Peter Schnorr;Antoine Joux;Andris Ambainis;Tanja Lange;Frédéric Magniez;Tetsu Iwata;Rainer Steinwandt;Maria Naya-Plasencia;Michele Mosca;Stacey Jeffery;Nils Gregor Leander;Yu Sasaki;Aleksandrs Belovs;John M. Schanck;Nicolas Sendrier;Daniel C. Smith-Tone;Fang Song;Jean-François Biasse;André Chailloux;Jintai Ding;Stavros Kousidis;Jean-Pierre Tillich;Bo-Yin Yang;Phong Nguyen;Shi Bai;Yfke Dulek;Maria Isabel González Vasco;Elena Kirshanova;Adriana Suárez Corona;Philippe Gaborit;Xavier Bonnetain;Martin Ekerå;András Gilyén;Akinori Hosoyamada;Samuel E. Jaques;Dustin Moody;Edoardo Persichetti;Rachel Player;Thomas Pöppelmann;André Schrottenloher;Yixin Shen;Marco Baldi;Thomas Debris-Alazard;Alexandru Paler;Galina Pass;Stephanie Reinhardt;Paolo Santini;Jana Sotáková;Floyd Johnson;Péter Kutas;François Le Gall;Ludovic Perret;Angela Robinson;Dániel Szabó</data>
