                    Adam Shostack, Matthew Smith, Sam Weber, and Mary Ellen Zurko
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1109/ICSE43902.2021.00053; https://doi.org/10.1145/3375890; https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-62230-5_10; https://doi.org/10.1109/MSEC.2022.3150238; https://doi.org/10.1145/3468264.3473926; https://cacm.acm.org/magazines/2020/5/244328-secure-development-tools-and-techniques-need-more-research-that-will-increase-their-impact-and-effectiveness-in-practice/fulltext; https://doi.org/10.1109/ICSE43902.2021.00053</data>
