      <data key="d12">Andreas Knüpfer;Kathryn Mohror;Martin Schulz;Marc Snir;Frank Mueller;Erwin Laure;Wolfgang Frings;André Brinkmann;Suren Byna;Philip Carns;Jay Lofstead;Osamu Tatebe;Weikuan Yu;Michele Weiland;Yi Ju;Julian Kunkel;Radita Liem;Sarah Neuwirth;Sebastian Oeste;Marcus Vincent Boden;Jim Brandt;Fahim Tahmid Chowdhury;Hariharan Devarajan;Ann Gentile;Sivalingam Karthee;Roland Laifer;Johann Lombardi;Stefano Markidis;Sandra Adriana Mendez;Sarp Oral;Michael Ott;Shane Snyder;Mehmet Soysal;Devesh Tiwari;Chen Wang</data>
