      <data key="d12">Jens Stoye;Péter L. Erdös;Yann Ponty;Michael Albert;David Bevan;Miklós Bóna;Mathilde Bouvel;Marilia Braga;Brona Brejova;Robert Brignall;Cedric Chauve;Anders Claesson;Niklas Eriksen;Pedro Feijão;Guillaume Fertin;Sylvie Hamel;Vít Jelínek;Anthony Labarre;Marie-Louise Lackner;Martin Lackner;Megan Martinez;István Miklós;Jay Pantone;Adeline Pierrot;Svetlana Poznanovik;Manda Riehl;Bruce Sagan;David Sankoff;Rebecca Smith;Einar Steingrimsson;Krister Swenson;Eric Tannier;Vincent Vatter;Stéphane Vialette;Tomas Vinar</data>
