      <data key="d10">Algebraic coding theory; complexity theory; cryptography; graph theory; graph based codes; information theory; randomized algorithms; networking; data distribution</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Algebraic coding theory; complexity theory; cryptography; graph theory; graph based codes; information theory; randomized algorithms; networking; data distribution; Algorithms and complexity; Networks; Cryptography; Algebraic techniques</data>
      <data key="d12">Axel Kohnert;Olgica Milenkovic;Daniel Augot;Gerard Cohen;Iwan M. Duursma;Heide Gluesing-Luerssen;Elisa Gorla;Marcus Greferath;Tor Helleseth;Tom Hoholdt;Anna-Lena Horlemann-Trautmann;Margreta Kuijper;P. Vijay Kumar;Hans-Andrea Loeliger;Felice Manganiello;Sihem Mesnager;Katherine Morrison;Joachim Rosenthal;Roxana Smarandache;Emina Soljanin;Bane Vasic;Judy L. Walker;Wolfgang Willems;Pascal Vontobel;Angela Barbero;Alexander Barg;Eimear Byrne;Pascale Charpin;Stark C. Draper;Salim El Rouayheb;Marcelo Firer;Hamed S. Hassani;Michael Heindlmaier;Werner Henkel;Tracey Ho;Jorn Justesen;Michael Lentmaier;Muriel Médard;Vladimir Sidorenko;Vitaly Skachek;Patrick Solé;Alex Sprintson;Vladimir D. Tonchev;Oyvind Ytrehus;Jiun-Hung Yu</data>
