      <data key="d12">Henning Schulzrinne;Timothy Roscoe;Julian Chesterfield;Lars Eggert;Dirk Kutscher;Jörg Ott;Gustavo Alonso;Tim Harris;Sue Moon;Yungang Bao;Angelos Bilas;Felix Eberhardt;Matthias Hille;Simon Peter;Leendert van Doorn;Noa Zilberman;Michio Honda;Max Plauth;Claude Barthels;Pietro Bressana;Trevor Carlson;Dilma Da Silva;David Hay;Timo Hönig;Stefan Klauck;Giuseppe Lettieri;Jacob Nelson;Dan Ports;Golan Schzukin;Eric Van Hensbergen;Irene Y. Zhang</data>
