      <data key="d11">evolutionary algorithms; bio-inspired search heuristics; theoretical analysis; optimization time; evolutionary algorithms; search heuristics; artificial intelligence; algorithms; optimization</data>
      <data key="d12">Thomas Jansen;Lothar Thiele;Hans-Georg Beyer;Anton V. Eremeev;William B. Langdon;Adam Prugel-Bennett;Jonathan Rowe;Jonathan L. Shapiro;Alden Wright;Benjamin Doerr;Anne Auger;Marcus Gallagher;Walter J. Gutjahr;Nikolaus Hansen;Christian Igel;Silja Meyer-Nieberg;R. Paul Wiegand;Carsten Witt;Günter Rudolph;Olivier Teytaud;Xin Yao;Dimo Brockhoff;Steffen Finck;Tobias Friedrich;Alexander Melkozerov;Frank Neumann;Pietro S. Oliveto;Dirk Sudholt;Darrell Whitley;Per Kristian Lehre;Nicola Hochstrate;Youhei Akimoto;Francisco Chicano;Carola Doerr;Verena Heidrich-Meisner;Christian Horoba;Daniel Johannsen;Timo Kötzing;Christian Müller;Gabriela Ochoa;Andrew M. Sutton;Madeleine Theile;Leslie Valiant;Sebastien Verel;Christine Zarges</data>
