      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">dependence logic; mathematical logic; computational complexity; finite model theory; game theory; data structures / algorithms / complexity; verification / logic</data>
      <data key="d12">Leopoldo Bertossi;Floris Geerts;Sebastian Link;Bernhard Thalheim;Jan Van den Bussche;Erich Grädel;David J. Pym;Dan Suciu;Val Tannen;Jef Wijsen;Bernd Finkbeiner;Dietmar Berwanger;Anuj Dawar;Arnaud Durand;Phokion G. Kolaitis;Heribert Vollmer;Lauri Hella;Joachim Biskup;Benny Kimelfeld;Martin Otto;Meghyn Bienvenu;Henri Prade;Juha Kontinen;Arne Meier;Jouko Väänänen;Eric Pacuit;Fredrik Engström;Miika Hannula;Åsa Hirvonen;Jonni Virtema;Fan Yang;Magdalena Ortiz;Martin Lück;Raine Rönnholm;Katrin Dannert;Gianluca Grilletti;Matthias Hoelzel;Paris Koutris;Yasir Mahmood;Richard Wilke</data>
