      <data key="d10">Security Engineering; Cryptography; Hardware; Usability; Software Engineering</data>
      <data key="d11">Security Engineering; Cryptography; Hardware; Usability; Software Engineering; security / cryptology; society / human-computer interaction</data>
      <data key="d12">Daniel J. Bernstein;Moti Yung;Frederik Armknecht;Tanja Lange;Felix Freiling;Ahmad-Reza Sadeghi;Kazue Sako;Melanie Volkamer;Marc C. Dacier;Hervé Debar;Michael Meier;Martina Angela Sasse;Florian Kerschbaum;Stefan Katzenbeisser;Ingrid Verbauwhede;Gabriele Lenzini;Kai Rannenberg;Christian Müller;Sebastian Pape;Vasily Mikhalev;Sven Dietrich;Magnus Almgren;Joachim Meyer;Edgar Weippl;Robert Biddle;Christoph Sorge;Ghassan Karame;Volkmar Lotz;Tigist Abera;Sarani Bhattacharya;Begül Bilgin;Dominik Brodowski;Fabio di Franco;Daisuke Fujimoto;Lucy Hunt;Youngwoo Kim;Olivier Levillain;Michalis Polychronakis;Stephan Somogyi;Borce Stojkovski;Lennert Wouters;Yuval Yarom</data>
