      <data key="d15">1; 1; 1; 1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">Encryption; Signatures; Cryptanalysis; Obfuscation; Homomorphic Encryption; Key Exchange; security / cryptology</data>
      <data key="d12">Johannes A. Buchmann;Antoine Joux;Krzysztof Pietrzak;Eike Kiltz;Jörn Müller-Quade;Marc Fischlin;Dennis Hofheinz;Alexander May;Tal Rabin;Kenneth G. Paterson;Iftach Haitner;Tal Malkin;Vinod Vaikuntanathan;Pooya Farshim;Dominique Schröder;Adekunle Oluseyi Afolabi;Fabrice Benhamouda;David Cash;Pierre-Alain Fouque;Vipul Goyal;Alexander Koch;Phong Nguyen;David Pointcheval;Sven Schäge;Suzanna Schmeelk;Jacob Schuldt;Hoeteck Wee</data>
