      <data key="d15">1</data>
      <data key="d11">algorithms; combinatorial optimization; planar graphs; graphs; approximation algorithms; fixed-parameter tractability; data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d12">Jeff Erickson;Matthias Müller-Hannemann;Sergio Cabello;Claire Mathieu;Sabine Cornelsen;Frederic Dorn;Rolf Niedermeier;Peter Rossmanith;Michelangelo Grigni;Therese Biedl;Dániel Marx;Anastasios Sidiropoulos;Erik Jan van Leeuwen;MohammadTaghi Hajiaghayi;Marcin Kaminski;Saket Saurabh;Daniel Lokshtanov;Matthias Mnich;Christian Wulff-Nilsen;Ignaz Rutter;Petr A. Golovach;Erin Moriarty Wolf Chambers;Yahav Nussbaum;Tamara Mchedlidze;Marcin Pilipczuk;Michal Pilipczuk;Yusuke Kobayashi;Oren Weimann;Mohammad Hossein Bateni;Ivona Bezáková;Glencora Borradaile;Éric Colin de Verdière;Arnaud de Mesmay;Alina Ene;Jittat Fakcharoenphol;Kyle Jordan Fox;Philip N. Klein;Nitish Korula;Shay Mozes;Amir Nayyeri</data>
