<<<<<<< HEAD
                    Christian P. Janssen,  Martin Baumann, Shamsi Tamara Iqbal, and Antti Oulasvirta
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.12.3.15</data>
      <data key="d9">Artificial Intelligence; Human-Computer Interaction; Machine Learning</data>
      <data key="d10">human-automation interaction; computational models; automated vehicles</data>
      <data key="d15">2</data>
      <data key="d11">human-automation interaction; computational models; automated vehicles; Artificial Intelligence; Human-Computer Interaction; Machine Learning</data>
      <data key="d12">Martin Fränzle;Antti Oulasvirta;Martin Baumann;Linda Ng Boyle;Duncan Brumby;Lewis Chuang;Christian P. Janssen;Myounghoon Jeon;Wendy Ju;Andrew Kun;Andreas Riener;Shadan Sadeghian Borojeni;Philipp Wintersberger;Jelmer Borst;Roderick Murray-Smith;Birsen Donmez;Nele Rußwinkel;Shamsi Tamara Iqbal;Benjamin Cowan;Alexandra Bremers;Debargha Dey;Patrick Ebel;Luisa Heinrich;Moritz Held;Jussi Jokinen;Dietrich Manstetten;Gustav Markkula;Hatice Sahin;Fei Yan;Justin Edwards;Mark Eilers;Xiaobei Jiang;Tuomo Kujala;Otto Lappi;Nikolas Martelaro;Boris van Waterschoot;Yiqi Zhang</data>
