      <data key="d8">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.8.10.87</data>
      <data key="d9">computer graphics / computer vision; modelling / simulation; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d10">shape analysis; shape reconstruction; mathematical morphology; algebraic geometry; optimization</data>
      <data key="d15">1; 1</data>
      <data key="d11">shape analysis; shape reconstruction; mathematical morphology; algebraic geometry; optimization; computer graphics / computer vision; modelling / simulation; optimization / scheduling</data>
      <data key="d12">Leila De Floriani;Alfred M. Bruckstein;Ron Kimmel;Martin Welk;Bert Jüttler;Tao Ju;Michael Breuß;Petros Maragos;Roberto Mecca;Sibel Tari;Laurent Younes;Frank R. Schmidt;William Smith;Silvia Tozza;Marianne Akian;Zorah Lähner;Jesús Angulo;Péter Balázs;Sara Brunetti;Vasileios Charisopoulos;Robert Dachsel;Panagiotis Filntisis;Federico Iuricich;Joe Kileel;Christer Oscar Kiselman;Gautam Pai</data>
