      <data key="d12">Christian Lengauer;Paul H. J. Kelly;Philippe Clauss;Albert Cohen;Benoit Meister;Paul Feautrier;Armin Größlinger;Barbara M. Chapman;Frank Hannig;P. (Saday) Sadayappan;Ayal Zaks;Madan Musuvathi;Sebastian Hack;Sven Verdoolaege;Richard M. Veras;Tobias Grosser;Louis-Noël Pouchet;Roland Leißa;James W. Demmel;Alexandra Jimborean;Lawrence Mitchell;Cédric Bastoul;Shigeru Chiba;Charisee Chiw;Johannes Doerfert;Andi Drebes;Stefan Ganser;Julian Hammer;Sriram Krishnamoorthy;Michael Kruse;Fabio Luporini;Victor Nicolet;Philip Pfaffe;Antoniu Pop;Jonathan Ragan-Kelley;Jun Shirako;Andreas Simbürger;Daniele G. Spampinato;Michel Steuwer;Tianjiao Sun;Nicolas T. Vasilache</data>
