                    Stefan Kratsch, Daniel Lokshtanov, Dániel Marx, and Peter Rossmanith
                &lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.4.11.1</data>
      <data key="d10">data structures / algorithms / complexity</data>
      <data key="d11">parameterized complexity; fixed-parameter tractability; NP-hardness; tight lower bounds</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
