      <data key="d14">https://doi.org/10.1089/cmb.2019.0309; https://doi.org/10.1145/3375890; https://doi.org/10.1089/cmb.2019.0316; https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.09517.pdf; https://arxiv.org/pdf/1811.12779.pdf; https://doi.org/10.1137/1.9781611975994.55; https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.CPM.2020.24; https://arxiv.org/pdf/1910.02151.pdf</data>
