      <data key="d12">Ian Munro;Roberto Grossi;Juha Kärkkäinen;Knut Reinert;Gene Myers;Jens Stoye;Yakov Nekrich;Veli Mäkinen;Gonzalo Navarro;Travis Gagie;Fabio Cunial;Enno Ohlebusch;Johannes Fischer;Pawel Gawrychowski;Rahul Shah;Sharma V. Thankachan;Rossano Venturini;Gabriele Fici;Marilia Braga;Simon Gog;Christina Boucher;Anthony J. Cox;Richard Durbin;Ben Langmead;Hideo Bannai;Tomohiro I;Nicola Prezza;Tatiana Starikovskaya;Dominik Köppl;Zsuzsanna Liptak;Giovanna Rosone;Jouni Sirén;Tomasz Kociumaka;Jarno Alanko;Paola Bonizzoni;Jackie Daykin;Wing-Kai Hon;Dominik Kempa;Sabrina Mantaci;Giovanni Manzini;Kunsoo Park;Kunihiko Sadakane;Leena Salmela;Marinella Sciortino;Sandip Sinha</data>
