      <data key="d12">Michael Beigl;Albrecht Schmidt;Eva Hornecker;Aurélien Tabard;Nicolai Marquardt;Andrew Kun;Audrey Girouard;Timothy Merritt;Anne Roudaut;Ruzanna Chitchyan;Brygg Ullmer;Andrea Bianchi;Anke Brock;Jessica Cauchard;Jeremy Cooperstock;Ellen Yi-Luen Do;Miriam Konkel;Sylvain Malacria;Amanda McLeod;Donald McMillan;Caitlin Mills;Simon Perrault;Thomas Pietrzak;Michal Rinott;Oliver Schneider;Orit Shaer;Jakub Sypniewski;Vicky Zeamer</data>
