      <data key="d12">Ulrich Carsten Meyer;Peter Sanders;Philipp Woelfel;Stefan Edelkamp;Malte Helmert;Stefan Leue;Martin Dietzfelbinger;Riko Jacob;Carsten Sinz;Eric Hansen;Deepak Ajwani;David A. Bader;Stefan Schwoon;Husain Aljazzar;Dragan Bosnacki;Sebastian Kupferschmid;Theo Ruys;Viktor Schuppan;Anton Wijs;Alberto Lluch Lafuente;Johannes Singler;Lubos Brim;Björn Borowsky;Gene Cooperman;Peter Kissmann;Hartmut Messerschmidt;Vitaly Osipov;Kairong Qian;Wheeler Ruml;Pavel Simecek;Nathan Sturtevant;Damian Sulewski;Enrico Tronci;Martin Wehrle;Rong Zhou</data>
=======
                    Georg Krempl, Vera Hofer, Geoffrey Webb, Eyke Hüllermeier
                &lt;/img&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 
</data>
      <data key="d9">https://doi.org/10.4230/DagRep.10.4.1</data>
      <data key="d10">artificial intelligence / robotics</data>
      <data key="d11">statistical machine learning; data streams; concept drift; non-stationary non-iid data; change mining</data>
