      <data key="d11">Information Visualization; Data Visualization; Visualization; Graphics; Applied Perception; Human-Computer Interaction; Empirical Evaluations; Crowdsourcing; computer graphics / computer vision; society / human-computer interaction; world wide web / internet</data>
      <data key="d12">Stephan Diehl;Andreas Kerren;Stephen G. Kobourov;Michelle X. Zhou;Dietmar Saupe;Min Chen;Helen C. Purchase;Sara Irina Fabrikant;Martin Nöllenburg;Tobias Hoßfeld;Sheelagh Carpendale;Bongshin Lee;Brian D. Fisher;Michael Wybrow;Sebastian Egger-Lampl;Sebastian Möller;Peter Rodgers;Daniel Archambault;Ina Wechsung;Tatiana von Landesberger;Alessandro Bozzon;Matthias Hirth;Christian Keimel;Babak Naderi;Ognjen Scekic;Remco Chang;Rita Borgo;Benjamin Bach;Kathrin Ballweg;Darren J. Edwards;Ujwal Gadiraju;Neha Gupta;Jason Jacques;Radu Jianu;David Martin;Andrea Mauri;Fintan McGee;Luana Micallef;Judith Redi;Paolo Simonetto</data>
