      <data key="d12">Gilles Barthe;Bruno Blanchet;Stephen Chong;Cédric Fournet;Michael Hicks;Dominique Unruh;Santiago Zanella-Béguelin;Karthikeyan Bhargavan;Florian Kerschbaum;Stefan Katzenbeisser;Véronique Cortier;Eran Tromer;Markulf Kohlweiss;Boris Köpf;Joseph Ayo Akinyele;David Archer;Manuel Barbosa;Dan Bogdanov;Niklas Büscher;Francois Dupressoir;Matthew A. Hammer;Catalin Hritcu;Sven Laur;Alex Malozemoff;Sarah Meiklejohn;Esfandiar Mohammadi;Axel Schröpfer;Alley Stoughton</data>
